var e=JSON.parse(`[{"id":1,"slug":"question-1","title":"执行上下文、词法环境和调用栈是什么关系？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>请区分规范抽象与引擎实现，说明三者如何协作；函数在另一作用域调用时，标识符查找顺序是否改变？</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q1-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>执行上下文是「一次代码执行所需的全部运行信息」的抽象，可以理解为它关联当前代码、词法环境与 <code>this</code>；词法环境负责标识符绑定并沿 outer reference 形成作用域链；调用栈则是承载这些上下文的栈式结构。三者不是同一层概念，不要混着说。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q1-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>词法环境</strong>在教学上可理解为绑定记录及外层链接；现代规范以 Environment Record 及 <code>[[OuterEnv]]</code> 描述。记录还有函数、全局、模块等种类，不能把 <code>var</code> 一律归为对象式记录：函数内 <code>var</code> 由函数环境记录承载，全局经典脚本的 <code>var</code> 才主要关联全局对象记录。</li>\\n<li><strong>变量查找顺序</strong>：先查当前环境记录，找不到就沿 outer reference 逐层向外，直到全局环境；仍找不到才抛 <code>ReferenceError</code>。</li>\\n<li><strong>作用域链由源码的词法嵌套位置决定</strong>，与函数在哪里被调用无关，这是闭包能读到外层变量的原因。</li>\\n<li><strong>执行上下文栈</strong>描述当前及被挂起的执行；函数调用通常对应入栈、返回对应出栈。<code>this</code> / <code>new.target</code> 等通过函数环境记录关联，规范抽象不等于引擎实际的机器栈内存布局。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> size = <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'global'</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">outer</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> size = <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'outer'</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> size <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 沿词法环境向外找到 outer 的 size</span>\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">outer</span>()()) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 'outer'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q1-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>「创建阶段/执行阶段」「变量对象（VO）/活动对象（AO）」来自 ES5 之前或教学抽象，用来理解可以，但不要宣称它们是现代规范的内部实现；ES2015+ 之后规范使用 Lexical Environment 与 Environment Record 描述。</li>\\n<li>浏览器<strong>经典脚本</strong>的全局环境包含对象记录与声明式记录；顶层 <code>var</code> / 函数声明通常关联全局对象属性，<code>let</code> / <code>const</code> 不会。ESM 顶层声明属于模块环境，不能照搬这条规则。</li>\\n<li>调用栈溢出抛出的是 <code>RangeError</code>，不是 <code>ReferenceError</code>，也不要和堆内存不足（<code>RangeError: Invalid string length</code> 之类）混为一谈。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q1-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>递归太深为什么栈溢出？因为每次未返回的调用都占一个栈帧，深度超过引擎限制即抛错；改写成循环或显式栈可以把空间搬到堆上。</li>\\n<li><code>this</code> 和词法环境有什么关系？<code>this</code> 由调用方式决定（箭头函数除外，它继承外层），与变量沿作用域链查找是两套独立规则。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/executable-code-and-execution-contexts.html#sec-environment-records\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">环境记录</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":34}},{"id":2,"slug":"question-2","title":"什么是变量提升？var、let、const 和函数声明有什么区别？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>以浏览器经典脚本与 ESM 为背景，解释作用域、绑定建立与初始化、TDZ；分析声明前读取、重复声明及函数表达式。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q2-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>\\"提升\\"是\\"进入作用域时先建立绑定\\"这一行为的观察结果，不是引擎真的把源码搬到顶部。<code>var</code> 的绑定会被初始化为 <code>undefined</code>；<code>let</code>/<code>const</code> 的绑定在声明语句执行前处于未初始化状态（TDZ），访问会抛 <code>ReferenceError</code>。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q2-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>差别主要来自绑定作用域及初始化时机，不是「var 用对象记录、let 用声明式记录」的简单分类。函数内 var 是函数作用域，let / const 是块作用域；ESM 顶层声明不会自动变成全局对象属性。</li>\\n<li><strong>函数声明</strong>在进入作用域时即完成绑定初始化，所以声明前可调用；<strong>函数表达式</strong>本质是赋值，声明前是 <code>undefined</code> 或 TDZ。</li>\\n<li><code>const</code> 限制的是绑定不可重新赋值，对象内容仍然可变。</li>\\n<li><code>class</code> 与 <code>let</code> 一样存在 TDZ，<code>new C()</code> 写在类声明之前会抛错。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(a) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// undefined</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">var</span> a = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sayHi</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// OK：函数声明已初始化</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sayHi</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(b) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// ReferenceError：本段执行在此中断</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> b = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q2-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>typeof undeclaredVar</code> 返回 <code>'undefined'</code> 不抛错；但 <code>typeof tdzVar</code> 会抛 <code>ReferenceError</code>，因为绑定已存在、只是尚未初始化。这两个\\"undefined\\"含义不同。</li>\\n<li>同一作用域内 <code>let</code> 与 <code>var</code> 重复声明同名变量是语法阶段的 <code>SyntaxError</code>（整段脚本都不执行），而重复 var 声明本身不会重新赋值，只有执行初始化表达式才改变已有值。</li>\\n<li>严格模式与 ESM 中块级函数声明是块作用域绑定；非严格经典脚本可能应用 Annex B 的兼容规则，增加函数/全局作用域绑定。不要把这些不同环境的规则混用。</li>\\n<li>浏览器经典脚本顶层 var / 函数声明通常关联全局对象属性；ESM 和 Node CommonJS 文件有模块作用域，不能套用。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q2-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么要引入 TDZ？</strong> 把\\"声明前使用\\"从静默拿到 <code>undefined</code> 变成显式报错，配合 <code>const</code> 帮助尽早暴露逻辑错误。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>for (let i...)</code> 为什么每轮都有独立的 <code>i</code>？</strong> 规范为每次迭代创建新的环境记录并复制上一轮的值，因此闭包捕获到的是每一轮各自的绑定。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/executable-code-and-execution-contexts.html#sec-functiondeclarationinstantiation\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">声明实例化</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":80}},{"id":3,"slug":"question-3","title":"闭包到底保存了什么？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript","闭包"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>用计数器与共享变量说明闭包捕获绑定还是值、何时保留环境，以及闭包与内存泄漏的区别。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q3-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>闭包是函数与其创建时可访问的词法环境的组合。它保存的是<strong>绑定本身</strong>，不是值的快照；只要闭包仍可达，它引用的环境记录就不会被回收。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q3-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">createCounter</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> count = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> ++count\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> a = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">createCounter</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> b = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">createCounter</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">a</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 1</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">a</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 2</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">b</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 1</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><code>a</code> 与 <code>b</code> 分别关联两次调用产生的不同环境记录，因此各有一份 <code>count</code>。同一环境被多个闭包共享时，它们看到的是同一个绑定：</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">pair</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> n = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> [<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> ++n, <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> n]\\r\\n}\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> [inc, read] = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">pair</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">inc</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">read</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 1：两个闭包共享同一个 n</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q3-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>闭包本身不是内存泄漏。只有当闭包长期可达，且不必要地引用大对象、DOM 节点、监听器或缓存时，相关对象才无法回收。</li>\\n<li>真实泄漏多半来自生命周期管理失误：定时器/监听器未清理、被闭包捕获的 DOM 引用、只增不减的全局缓存。定位靠 Memory 面板做前后 heap snapshot 对比，而不是凭感觉断言。</li>\\n<li>引擎会对闭包做逃逸分析，可能只保留被实际引用的绑定，但这是实现细节，不能作为正确性依赖。</li>\\n<li><code>for (var i = ...)</code> 共享函数级绑定，<code>for (let i = ...)</code> 每次迭代新建绑定，这是异步回调里\\"都打印同一个值\\"的根因。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q3-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>回调读到的变量为什么不对？</strong> 通常是与外层共享了同一个绑定；用 <code>let</code> 或把当前值作为参数传入即可隔离。</li>\\n<li><strong>闭包与 this 有关吗？</strong> 词法变量捕获不决定普通函数的 this；箭头函数没有自己的 this 绑定，会沿词法环境读取外层 this，常称为捕获词法 this。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":127}},{"id":4,"slug":"question-4","title":"this 的值如何确定？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>分析严格模式独立调用、方法、call/apply/bind、new 与箭头函数的 this，并说明方法回调和绑定函数被 new 调用的边界。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q4-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>普通函数的 <code>this</code> 由<strong>调用方式</strong>在运行时决定，不由定义位置决定。先区分构造调用、绑定函数、方法调用与独立调用；「new > 显式绑定 > 隐式绑定」是记忆法，不能覆盖箭头函数及宿主回调的全部规则。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q4-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>默认绑定：严格模式下 <code>this</code> 是 <code>undefined</code>，非严格模式是全局对象。</li>\\n<li><code>bind</code> 返回绑定后的新函数，绑定结果不能再被 <code>call</code>/<code>apply</code> 覆盖。</li>\\n<li>箭头函数没有自己的 <code>this</code>（也没有 <code>arguments</code>、<code>new.target</code>），它沿用定义时外层函数的 <code>this</code>，因此不能作为构造函数。</li>\\n<li>类体默认严格模式；类字段中的箭头函数会捕获创建时实例的 <code>this</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> user = {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">name</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'A'</span>,\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">normal</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) { <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">name</span> },\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">arrow</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>?.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">name</span>,\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\nuser.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">normal</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 'A'：调用点是 user</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> detached = user.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">normal</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">detached</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 严格模式因 this === undefined 抛 TypeError；非严格模式读全局 name</span>\\r\\nuser.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">arrow</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 取决于定义位置的外层 this，与 user 无关</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q4-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>单独传出方法值会失去原方法调用的接收者；回调 API 可能指定自己的 this / thisArg（例如 arr.map(fn, receiver)）。需要保留原对象时用 bind 或箭头函数包装。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>事件监听器里的 <code>this</code> 是 <code>currentTarget</code>（普通函数），而 <code>event.target</code> 是实际触发元素；箭头函数拿不到 <code>this</code>，但可以用 <code>event.currentTarget</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>非严格模式与严格模式的默认绑定不同，而 ESM、类体、<code>\\"use strict\\"</code> 都是严格模式，所以不要再按\\"<code>this</code> 默认是 window\\"背结论。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>new (obj.fn)()</code> 走 <code>new</code> 规则，<code>this</code> 是新建实例而不是 <code>obj</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>new 调用可构造的绑定函数时忽略绑定的 thisArg，仍保留预绑定参数；给箭头函数 bind 不会赋予它构造能力。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q4-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>怎样在回调里保住 <code>this</code>？</strong> 首选箭头函数或显式 <code>bind</code>；避免用 <code>const self = this</code> 这类遗留写法。</li>\\n<li><strong>箭头函数适合当对象方法吗？</strong> 一般不适合，它拿不到调用者对象；适合用在需要固定外层 <code>this</code> 的回调里。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":181}},{"id":5,"slug":"question-5","title":"new Foo() 做了什么？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>说明普通基类构造的创建、原型、this 与返回值规则；解释派生类例外及 Object.create + apply 无法覆盖的语义。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q5-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>new Foo()</code> 的核心是四步：创建新对象 → 把新对象的 <code>[[Prototype]]</code> 指向 <code>Foo.prototype</code> → 以新对象为 <code>this</code> 执行 <code>Foo</code> → 若构造函数返回对象类型的值就采用它，否则返回新对象。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q5-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">construct</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">Ctor, ...args</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 标准内建负责校验 [[Construct]]，支持 class 与内置构造函数</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Reflect</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">construct</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Ctor</span>, args)\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>四步描述适用于普通基类构造。Reflect.construct(Ctor, args, NewTarget) 可显式指定 new.target；Object.create + apply 只能近似普通函数，无法完整实现 new。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q5-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>构造函数返回<strong>原始值</strong>（<code>return 1</code>）或 <code>null</code> 时会被忽略，仍然返回新对象；只有对象/函数类型的返回值才生效。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>箭头函数没有 <code>[[Construct]]</code>，不能用 <code>new</code>；类构造函数不加 <code>new</code> 调用会抛 <code>TypeError</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>Foo.prototype</code> 不是对象时（如被赋值为 <code>1</code>），new 会退化为使用构造目标所属 realm 的 Object.prototype 作为原型，这是规范行为但属于糟糕写法。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>近似实现不能替代 <code>Reflect.construct</code>：类构造函数无法用 <code>apply</code> 调用，派生类的 <code>new.target</code> 语义也无法还原。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>判断是否经构造调用用 new.target；this instanceof Foo 只检查原型关系，普通调用也能通过 call 传入已有实例而得到 true。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>派生类在 super() 前没有已初始化的 this；返回对象可替代实例，显式返回非 undefined 原始值则抛 TypeError，不能套用基类「忽略原始返回值」。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q5-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>new.target</code> 有什么用？</strong> 区分\\"直接调用\\"与\\"<code>new</code> 调用\\"，实现抽象基类检查，或在派生类中把真正的构造目标继续传给父类。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>instanceof</code> 能替代类型判断吗？</strong> 不能完全替代：它依赖原型链，跨 realm（例如 iframe）可能失效；Worker 消息通常在接收方重新结构化克隆，不能与直接引用另一 realm 的实例混为一谈，也可能被 <code>Symbol.hasInstance</code> 改写。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/ordinary-and-exotic-objects-behaviours.html#sec-ecmascript-function-objects-construct-argumentslist-newtarget\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">构造语义</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":230}},{"id":6,"slug":"question-6","title":"原型链如何工作？prototype 与 __proto__ 有什么区别？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript","原型链"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>区分内部原型、构造函数 prototype 和 <strong>proto</strong>；同时分析读取、继承 setter 和不可写属性对赋值的影响。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q6-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>普通对象通过内部槽 <code>[[Prototype]]</code> 关联原型，属性读取沿链逐层查找到 null；Proxy 等特殊对象还可能通过内部方法/陷阱自定义行为。<code>prototype</code> 与 <code>[[Prototype]]</code> 是两个不同层次的东西：前者是<strong>函数对象上的普通属性</strong>，在 <code>new</code> 时被用作新实例的原型；后者是<strong>对象自身的原型链接</strong>，<code>__proto__</code> 只是访问它的历史遗留访问器。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q6-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">User</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {}\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> u = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">User</span>()\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(u) === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">User</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">User</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">User</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">__proto__</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true，与上一行是同一件事</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// null，链条终点</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>读取</strong> <code>obj.x</code>：先查自身属性，再沿 <code>[[Prototype]]</code> 向上；沿链上访问到的 getter 会被执行。</li>\\n<li><strong>写入</strong> <code>obj.x = v</code>：通常创建/修改<strong>自身</strong>属性；如果链上存在同名 setter，会调用该 setter 而不创建自身属性；如果自身是不可写数据属性，严格模式抛 <code>TypeError</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q6-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>不要用 <code>__proto__</code> 做业务代码的读写：它只是 <code>Object.prototype</code> 上的访问器，<code>Object.create(null)</code> 出来的对象根本没有它。应使用 <code>Object.getPrototypeOf</code> / <code>Object.setPrototypeOf</code> / <code>Object.create</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>Object.setPrototypeOf</code> 会破坏引擎对对象形状的优化，能通过 <code>Object.create</code> 确定原型的就不要事后改原型。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>instanceof</code> 检查\\"构造函数的<strong>当前</strong> <code>prototype</code> 是否在对象原型链上\\"，因此替换 <code>Fn.prototype</code> 后旧实例会失效，跨 realm 也会失效。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>遍历语义要区分：<code>for...in</code> 会枚举原型链上的可枚举属性，<code>Object.keys</code> 只看自身可枚举字符串键，<code>Reflect.ownKeys</code> 返回自身全部键（含 symbol）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>原型链上的不可写数据属性也会阻止普通赋值创建同名自身属性；继承访问器没有 setter 同样阻止写入。严格模式抛错，非严格模式通常静默失败。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q6-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>Object.create(null)</code> 有什么实际用途？</strong> 无原型字典可减少继承属性和特殊访问器冲突；它不保证后续递归合并到普通对象时安全，仍需校验不可信路径键或使用 Map（见第 153 题）。</li>\\n<li><strong>为什么推荐 <code>Object.hasOwn(obj, key)</code>？</strong> 对象自身可能覆盖 <code>hasOwnProperty</code>，无原型对象上则不存在该方法；<code>Object.hasOwn</code> 是静态方法，不受这两点影响。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/ordinary-and-exotic-objects-behaviours.html#sec-ordinarysetwithowndescriptor\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">OrdinarySet</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":273}},{"id":7,"slug":"question-7","title":"JavaScript class 是不是传统面向对象语言里的类？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>解释 class 的原型模型及 TDZ、严格模式、私有字段、super 与字段初始化，说明「语法糖」这一说法的限制。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q7-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>不是另一种运行机制：<code>class</code> 建立在原型继承之上，属于语法糖。但它带有一批独立的语言语义，因此也不能简单说\\"就是函数加 <code>prototype</code>\\"。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q7-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">User</span> {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">method</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {}      <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 定义在 User.prototype 上，不可枚举，各实例共享</span>\\r\\n  field = <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {} <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 每个实例自身的属性，每次构造都新建一个函数</span>\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>与手写构造函数 + <code>prototype</code> 的差异：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>类声明存在 TDZ，不像函数声明那样声明前可用。</li>\\n<li>类体整体运行在严格模式。</li>\\n<li>原型方法默认 <code>enumerable: false</code>，手写挂载默认是可枚举的。</li>\\n<li>必须用 <code>new</code> 调用，内部走 <code>[[Construct]]</code>。</li>\\n<li>支持 <code>super</code>、私有字段 <code>#x</code>、静态块、<code>get</code>/<code>set</code>、以及 <code>extends</code> 内置类型（如 <code>Array</code>、<code>Error</code>）。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q7-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>基类实例字段先于基类 constructor 正文初始化；派生类字段在 super() 返回后、后续语句前初始化。父类 constructor 调用子类原型方法时，子类字段还未初始化。</li>\\n<li>类字段用箭头函数会为每个实例复制一个函数，内存上不如原型方法，但能自动绑定 <code>this</code>；按使用场景取舍，不要无脑统一。</li>\\n<li>私有字段 <code>#x</code> 是语法层面的真私有（外部无法访问、不能通过 <code>Reflect.get</code> 读取），与 <code>_x</code> 这种命名约定完全不同。</li>\\n<li><code>typeof MyClass</code> 在类声明之前会抛错（TDZ），不能靠 <code>typeof</code> 做\\"未定义\\"探测。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q7-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>子类不写 constructor 会怎样？</strong> 默认派生构造转发参数并初始化派生字段，可用 constructor(...args) { super(...args) } 近似理解；规范在参数迭代等细节上不完全等价。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>super</code> 的两种用法？</strong> <code>super(...)</code> 调用父类构造函数；<code>super.method()</code> 在父类原型上查找方法，但 <code>this</code> 仍是当前实例。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":319}},{"id":8,"slug":"question-8","title":"属性描述符有什么用？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>区分数据属性与访问器属性，分析 defineProperty 默认值、枚举、重定义、seal/freeze 及对象展开的边界。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q8-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>属性描述符精确控制一个属性的读、写、枚举与重定义能力。数据属性用 <code>value/writable/enumerable/configurable</code>，访问器属性用 <code>get/set/enumerable/configurable</code>，两类互斥，不能混写。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q8-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> obj = {}\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">defineProperty</span>(obj, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'id'</span>, {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">value</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>,\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">writable</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>,\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">enumerable</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>,\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">configurable</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>,\\r\\n})\\r\\n\\r\\nobj.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>       <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 非严格模式静默失败，严格模式抛 TypeError</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">keys</span>(obj) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// []：不可枚举，不参与遍历与展开</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">delete</span> obj.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>    <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 非严格模式静默失败，严格模式抛 TypeError</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Object.defineProperty 创建新属性时，未给出的布尔标志默认为 false；重新定义已有属性时，省略的字段通常维持原值；对象字面量的普通数据属性，其 writable / enumerable / configurable 三个布尔标志通常都是 true，value 不是标志。这是最容易踩的差异。</li>\\n<li><code>Object.freeze</code> 置为不可写且不可配置，<code>Object.seal</code> 阻止新增并令已有属性不可配置，数据属性仍按原 writable 决定能否改值；两者都是<strong>浅层</strong>。</li>\\n<li>键的枚举层次：<code>Object.keys</code>（自身可枚举字符串键）⊂ <code>Object.getOwnPropertyNames</code>（自身字符串键）⊂ <code>Reflect.ownKeys</code>（再加 symbol 键）。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q8-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>writable: false</code> 不等于值不可变：如果值是对象，其内部属性仍可修改。真正的不可变需要递归冻结或使用不可变数据结构。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>configurable: false</code> 无法恢复为 <code>true</code>；此时不能把数据属性改成访问器属性（反之亦然），不可写数据属性不能恢复可写；可写属性仍能改 value，或单向把 writable 改为 false；访问器的 get/set 不能任意替换。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>展开与 <code>Object.assign</code> 只复制自身可枚举属性，会触发 getter、丢弃描述符与原型，且都是浅拷贝。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>Object.freeze</code> 不会冻结 <code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code> 的内部内容，也不能阻止通过其他引用修改嵌套对象。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>freeze 不撤掉访问器 setter，setter 仍可能修改其他对象或闭包状态；它也不冻结 Map / Set 内部集合状态。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q8-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>enumerable: false</code> 有什么用？</strong> 让属性不参与 Object.keys、展开等可枚举遍历；Reflect.ownKeys 和直接读取仍能发现它，不能作为私有状态或安全隔离。</li>\\n<li><strong>响应式系统为什么关心描述符？</strong> Vue 2 用 <code>Object.defineProperty</code> 递归改写 getter/setter 来收集依赖，因此无法侦测新增属性和数组下标赋值，需要 <code>Vue.set</code> 兜底；Vue 3 改用 <code>Proxy</code> 拦截整个对象来解决。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":363}},{"id":9,"slug":"question-9","title":"JavaScript 的值类型与引用语义应该怎样准确表述？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>列出原始值与对象，以修改形参对象和重新赋值形参区分按值传递与共享身份，不用栈/堆位置代替语义。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q9-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>JavaScript 的参数传递<strong>始终是按值传递</strong>。差异来自值本身是什么：原始值复制的是值本身；对象复制的是\\"指向该对象的引用\\"这个值，因此两个变量指向同一个对象。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q9-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">mutate</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">x</span>) { x.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">name</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'B'</span> }\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">replace</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">x</span>) { x = { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">name</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'C'</span> } }\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> user = { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">name</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'A'</span> }\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">mutate</span>(user)  <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// user.name === 'B'：通过引用改到同一个对象</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">replace</span>(user) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// user 仍是 { name: 'B' }：给形参重新赋值不影响调用方</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>变量是绑定，保存的要么是原始值，要么是对象引用。</li>\\n<li><code>const</code> 约束的是绑定不能重新赋值，不约束对象内部状态的变化。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q9-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>不要说\\"对象是引用传递\\"。引用传递（如 C++ 的 <code>&#x26;</code>）意味着给形参赋值会改变调用方变量，JS 做不到——这正是 <code>replace(user)</code> 无效的原因。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>\\"原始值 vs 引用值\\"是常见简化说法；更准确的表述是\\"值本身是否为对象\\"，<code>typeof</code>/装箱等细节会带来偏差。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>比较对象用 <code>===</code> 比较的是引用身份，不是内容；<code>Object.is</code> 的差异只在 <code>NaN</code> 与 <code>-0</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>字符串等原始值不可变，任何\\"修改\\"都是产生新值再重新绑定。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>七类原始值是 undefined、null、boolean、number、bigint、string、symbol；函数是可调用对象。typeof null 返回 object 是历史行为，不代表 null 属于对象。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q9-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 <code>const</code> 声明的数组还能 <code>push</code>？</strong> 绑定没变，变的是对象内部状态。</li>\\n<li><strong>怎样避免共享引用带来的副作用？</strong> 在边界处复制（浅/深拷贝，见第 12 题），或按不可变更新约定只替换变化路径。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":412}},{"id":10,"slug":"question-10","title":"==、=== 与 Object.is 有什么差异？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>比较类型转换、NaN、±0 和对象身份，并补充 SameValueZero、Map/Set 与 React 的相等语义。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q10-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>三者的差异集中在两点：是否做类型转换、如何处理 <code>NaN</code> 与 <code>-0</code>。<code>===</code> 不做类型转换，但 <code>NaN !== NaN</code> 且 <code>0 === -0</code>；<code>Object.is</code> 使用 SameValue 语义，<code>NaN</code> 等于自身、<code>0</code> 与 <code>-0</code> 不相等；<code>==</code> 会走抽象相等比较并按规则转换类型。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q10-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> === -<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>            <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">is</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>, -<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>)    <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// false</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">NaN</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">NaN</span>         <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// false</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">is</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">NaN</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">NaN</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> == <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>   <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">''</span> == <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>             <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'1'</span> == <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>            <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\r\\n[] == <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>         <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><code>==</code> 的判定顺序：同类型直接比较；<code>null</code> 与 <code>undefined</code> 互相相等且不等于其他值；数字与字符串比较时转数字；布尔先转数字；对象与原始值比较时先用 <code>ToPrimitive</code> 转换对象。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q10-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>Object.is</code> 与 <code>===</code> <strong>只在 <code>NaN</code> 和 <code>-0</code> 上有差异</strong>，不要以为它是全面更严格的比较。它的语义是把 <code>NaN</code> 视为相等，因此常被用于\\"值是否相同\\"的判断。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>React 在 <code>useState</code> 的更新 bailout、<code>useEffect</code>/<code>useMemo</code> 的依赖比较中采用 <code>Object.is</code> 语义。这解释了：写入 <code>NaN</code> 不会被视为变化，而 <code>0</code> 与 <code>-0</code> 会被视为不同值。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>x == null</code> 是少数被团队普遍接受的简写（同时匹配 <code>null</code> 和 <code>undefined</code>），其他场景优先 <code>===</code>，并用 lint 的 <code>eqeqeq</code> 规则约束。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>==</code> 与 <code>&#x3C;</code>、<code>></code> 的转换规则并不完全一致，不要用同一套直觉推断。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Map / Set / includes 使用 SameValueZero：NaN 相等且 ±0 相等；indexOf 用严格相等，因此找不到 NaN。对象仍按身份比较。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>上述 == 规则是常见子集，还存在 BigInt 比较及浏览器 document.all 的历史例外，工程代码不要依赖例外表达空值。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q10-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 <code>[] == false</code> 为 true？</strong> 布尔先转数字得到 <code>0</code>，<code>[]</code> 经 <code>ToPrimitive</code> 得到 <code>\\"\\"</code> 再转成 <code>0</code>，于是相等。</li>\\n<li><strong>什么时候必须用 <code>Object.is</code>？</strong> 需要把 <code>NaN</code>/<code>-0</code> 纳入值语义比较时（如自定义缓存键、实现快照比较），或与框架的相等判断保持一致时。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-testing-and-comparison-operations\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">相等比较</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":455}},{"id":11,"slug":"question-11","title":"隐式类型转换最容易错在哪里？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>按 ToPrimitive、拼接、数值转换和关系比较推导例子；说明 BigInt、Symbol、空字符串与业务输入校验。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q11-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>对象转原始值走 <code>ToPrimitive</code>：优先调用 <code>Symbol.toPrimitive</code>，否则按 hint（<code>number</code>、<code>string</code>、<code>default</code>）依次尝试 <code>valueOf</code> 和 <code>toString</code>。<code>+</code> 同时承担数字加法与字符串拼接，<code>-</code> / <code>*</code> 走数值转换；<code>&#x3C;</code> / <code>></code> 先转原始值，双方是字符串时按 UTF-16 码元序列比较，否则进入数值比较，因此出错几乎都源自\\"没意识到发生了转换\\"。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q11-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span> + <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'2'</span>        <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// '12'：有字符串就是拼接</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'5'</span> - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>        <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 3：算术运算强制转数字</span>\\r\\n[] + []        <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// ''</span>\\r\\n[] + {}        <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// '[object Object]'</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Boolean</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'0'</span>)   <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true：非空字符串是真</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">''</span>)     <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 0</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">' 12 '</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 12</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">parseInt</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'12px'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 12：忽略尾部垃圾</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'12px'</span>)   <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// NaN</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q11-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>关系运算遇到字符串会按字典序比较：<code>'10' &#x3C; '9'</code> 为 <code>true</code>，这是\\"数值比较\\"最常见的踩坑点。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>Number('')</code>、<code>Number(' ')</code>、<code>Number(null)</code> 都是 <code>0</code>，但 <code>Number(undefined)</code> 是 <code>NaN</code>；<code>parseInt</code> 需要显式传 radix，虽然 ES5 后 <code>'08'</code> 不再按八进制解析。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>浮点精度：<code>0.1 + 0.2 !== 0.3</code>；金额应按最小单位用整数或 <code>BigInt</code> 处理（见第 97 题）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>BigInt</code> 不能与 <code>Number</code> 隐式混算（<code>1n + 1</code> 抛 <code>TypeError</code>），<code>JSON.stringify</code> 遇到 <code>BigInt</code> 也会抛错。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>面试重点不是背怪题结论，而是能说清转换路径；工程上应在输入边界显式解析并校验（<code>Number.isNaN</code>、<code>Number.isInteger</code>）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Symbol.toPrimitive 必须返回原始值，否则抛 TypeError；普通对象 string hint 先尝试 toString，number / default hint 通常先尝试 valueOf，Date 对 default 有特殊处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>转 Number 后仍要校验：Number.isFinite 排除 NaN / Infinity，但不替你判断业务范围、空输入、单位与小数位。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q11-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>[] == ![]</code> 为什么为 true？</strong> <code>![]</code> 先得到 <code>false</code>，再走 <code>==</code>：一侧转数字 0，另一侧 <code>[]</code> 先 <code>ToPrimitive</code> 成 <code>\\"\\"</code> 再转 0。</li>\\n<li><strong>怎样系统性减少这类问题？</strong> 统一用 <code>===</code>、开启 TypeScript <code>strict</code>、输入边界做显式解析与校验、用 lint 规则约束。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-toprimitive\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ToPrimitive</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":503}},{"id":12,"slug":"question-12","title":"浅拷贝、深拷贝与结构化克隆有什么区别？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>用嵌套、共享子对象和循环引用比较三种复制方式，说明类型支持、原型、描述符与 transfer 的限制。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q12-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>浅拷贝只复制第一层，嵌套对象仍与源共享引用；深拷贝按约定复制对象图中的节点与关联；<code>structuredClone</code> 是平台提供的结构化克隆算法，支持循环引用和多数内置类型，但不支持函数、DOM 节点与原型语义。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q12-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> source = { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">child</span>: { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">count</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span> } }\\r\\nsource.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">self</span> = source\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> shallow = { ...source }\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> cloned = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">structuredClone</span>(source)\\r\\n\\r\\nshallow.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">child</span> === source.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">child</span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true：共享嵌套对象</span>\\r\\ncloned.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">child</span> !== source.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">child</span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true：克隆嵌套对象</span>\\r\\ncloned.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">self</span> === cloned <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true：保留循环关系</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q12-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(x))</code> <strong>不是</strong>可靠深拷贝：丢失 <code>undefined</code>、函数、symbol，<code>Date</code> 变字符串，<code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code> 变 <code>{}</code>，<code>BigInt</code> 抛错，循环引用抛错，<code>NaN</code>/<code>Infinity</code> 变 <code>null</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>structuredClone</code> 不能克隆函数、DOM 节点、<code>Proxy</code>；类实例会丢失原型变成普通对象，普通对象的可枚举自身字符串属性会被读取，getter 可能执行，setter 与访问器描述符不保留。<code>ArrayBuffer</code> 可通过 <code>transfer</code> 转移所有权而非复制。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>浅拷贝手段（展开、<code>Object.assign</code>、<code>slice</code>、<code>concat</code>）都只处理第一层，且不复制描述符与原型。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>React 场景中整体深拷贝通常是坏味道：既昂贵又会切断引用比较带来的性能收益，正确做法是只复制变化路径。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>深拷贝应保持共享关系：源中 a === b 的两条边通常指向同一个副本，而不只是防递归。结构化克隆不保留 symbol 键、描述符及所有内置状态（例如 RegExp.lastIndex）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>ArrayBuffer 使用 transfer 后原缓冲区被分离，源数据不再可用，不能当作无副作用复制。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q12-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>structuredClone</code> 为什么能处理循环引用？</strong> 内部维护已访问对象的映射（与第 92 题用 WeakMap 保存源对象到副本映射的思路相同）。</li>\\n<li><strong>什么时候真的需要深拷贝？</strong> 跨边界传递会被外部修改的数据、需要独立快照、或必须切断引用共享时；其余情况优先不可变更新。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/structured-data.html#safe-passing-of-structured-data\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">结构化克隆</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":550}},{"id":13,"slug":"question-13","title":"浏览器 Event Loop 如何运行？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript","Event Loop"],"estimatedMinutes":3,"promptHtml":"<p>限定浏览器环境，解释 task、微任务检查点和渲染机会；分析多个 task source、定时器阈值与微任务饥饿。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q13-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>事件循环按轮推进：每轮取出一个宏任务执行完 → 清空微任务队列 → 浏览器在合适时机更新渲染 → 进入下一轮。宏任务包括定时器回调、用户事件、网络回调、<code>MessageChannel</code> 等；微任务包括 Promise reaction、<code>queueMicrotask</code>、<code>MutationObserver</code>。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q13-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>微任务检查点</strong>按队列执行至空，包含新追加的微任务；当前 task 结束后通常有检查点，某些回调结束且执行栈为空时也会触发，不能记成「每个 task 恰好一次」。</li>\\n<li><code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code> 只保证\\"不早于阈值\\"：主线程被占用、后台标签页节流、嵌套超过 5 层后浏览器最小 4ms 延迟都会让它更晚。</li>\\n<li><code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 回调在下一帧渲染前执行，属于渲染步骤，不是普通宏任务；<code>requestIdleCallback</code> 只在空闲时段运行。</li>\\n<li>一次宏任务只取一个：长同步代码会阻塞渲染与输入响应。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'sync'</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'macro'</span>), <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>().<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'micro'</span>))\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// sync → micro → macro</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q13-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>微任务里持续追加微任务会<strong>饿死</strong>渲染与后续宏任务（<code>while (true) await tick()</code> 会卡死页面）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>规范只规定\\"浏览器在合适时机渲染\\"，不保证每轮都渲染，也不保证每帧与宏任务一一对应。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Node.js 的事件循环有独立阶段划分（timers、poll、check 等），不要用浏览器的顺序表解释 Node 行为。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>微任务结束后立刻读取布局会强制同步布局，把读写混在一起会造成 layout thrashing。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>HTML 规范称 task，「宏任务」是教学称呼。浏览器存在多个 task source / queue，不保证网络、输入与定时器都在一个全局 FIFO 队列。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Promise reaction 先于定时器适用于本任务内已入队的示例；若 Promise 尚未落定，定时器可以先执行。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q13-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 <code>setTimeout(fn, 0)</code> 有时明显延迟？</strong> 主线程被长任务占用、页面处于后台被节流，或嵌套层级触发最小延迟。</li>\\n<li><strong>微任务适合做什么？</strong> 需要在\\"本轮同步代码全部结束、渲染之前\\"完成的一致性收尾，例如框架的批量更新，Vue 的 <code>nextTick</code> 就是这一思路。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#event-loops\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">事件循环</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":595}},{"id":14,"slug":"question-14","title":"输出顺序题：同步代码、Promise 和定时器","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","Promise"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>假设以下代码在浏览器同一同步任务内执行，给出输出及每一步微任务队列，解释链式 then 与 queueMicrotask 的入队时机。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'A'</span>)\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'B'</span>), <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>)\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'C'</span>)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">queueMicrotask</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'D'</span>))\\r\\n  })\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'E'</span>))\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">queueMicrotask</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'F'</span>))\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'G'</span>)\\n</code></pre>","answerSections":[{"id":"q14-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>输出 <code>A G C F D E B</code>。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q14-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<p>按阶段推导，而不是靠直觉：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>同步阶段</strong>：打印 <code>A</code>；注册宏任务（B）；<code>Promise.resolve().then(C)</code> 把 C 的反应入队；<code>queueMicrotask(F)</code> 把 F 入队；打印 <code>G</code>。</li>\\n<li>此刻微任务队列为 <code>[C, F]</code>。</li>\\n<li>执行 C：打印 <code>C</code>，并在回调里把 D 入队；C 的回调返回后，前一个 promise 落定，<code>.then(E)</code> 的反应才入队。队列变为 <code>[F, D, E]</code>。</li>\\n<li>依次执行 F、D、E，打印 <code>F D E</code>。微任务队列清空。</li>\\n<li>进入下一个宏任务，执行定时器回调，打印 <code>B</code>。</li>\\n</ol>\\n<p>关键顺序点：E 要等 C 所在的 reaction 完成后由派生 promise 落定才入队，因此排在 D 之后，而不是紧随 C。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q14-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>then</code> 在标准 Promise 上注册的 reaction 异步执行；任意自定义 thenable 的 then 方法本身可以同步调用，二者不同。</li>\\n<li>这道题背顺序没有意义：把 <code>queueMicrotask</code> 换成 <code>setTimeout(…, 0)</code>、把链改成 <code>await</code>、或加上 <code>Promise.all</code>，结果都会变，必须能重新推导。</li>\\n<li><code>setTimeout</code> 的最小延迟与后台节流会让 B 更晚，但不改变其他元素的相对顺序。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q14-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 D 一定在 E 之前？</strong> D 是在 C 回调里主动入队的；E 的入队时机是 C 所在 reaction 结束后。</li>\\n<li><strong>如果第一个 then 里抛错会怎样？</strong> E 被跳过，错误沿链穿透到下一个 catch 或全局 <code>unhandledrejection</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q14-section-4","title":"评分点","html":"\\n<p>不仅说出顺序，还能画出每一步的队列变化，并能口述\\"哪个操作导致哪个 reaction 入队\\"。</p>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/webappapis.html#perform-a-microtask-checkpoint\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">微任务检查点</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":641}},{"id":15,"slug":"question-15","title":"async/await 的本质是什么？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>说明 async 启动与返回值、await 暂停/恢复、错误归属及 return await 的差异，不固定断言微任务数量。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q15-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>async</code> 函数的返回值总是 Promise（普通值被包装为 fulfilled，抛错变成 rejected）；<code>await</code> 把其后的代码变成\\"等 Promise settle 后由微任务恢复\\"的 continuation，因此不会阻塞线程。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q15-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">run</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>)\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">3</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">run</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">log</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">4</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 3 1 4 2</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>即使 <code>await</code> 的是非 Promise 值，后续代码也<strong>不会</strong>在当前同步执行栈里继续，而是被安排到微任务队列。</li>\\n<li><code>await p</code> 近似等于先对 <code>p</code> 做 <code>Promise.resolve(p)</code> 再 <code>then</code>，因此 thenable 会被展开，非 thenable 也会产生一次异步跳转。</li>\\n<li><code>async</code> 函数里 <code>throw</code> 等价于返回 rejected Promise，<code>return value</code> 等价于 resolve。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q15-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>try/catch 能捕获 await 的拒绝和当前同步求值抛错，接不住未关联链的异步错误。遗漏 Promise 的拒绝可能触发 unhandledrejection；定时器回调的同步 throw 则通常走全局 error。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>循环里逐次 <code>await</code> 是<strong>串行</strong>等待、耗时叠加；要并发应先 <code>Promise.all(tasks.map(...))</code> 再统一等待。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>return await 在本函数内等待，拒绝进入本层 catch，finally 在等待结束后执行；直接 return promise 时本层 finally 先执行，后续拒绝由返回的 Promise 传播。现代引擎会优化 await，不能固定断言 return await 多一次微任务或一定更慢。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>async 函数被调用时函数体<strong>立即同步执行</strong>到第一个 <code>await</code>，不是等到被 await 才启动。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>async 函数采用返回 Promise 的状态，但对象身份不同：async function f(p) { return p } 中 f(p) !== p。启动时机、状态传播与对象身份应分别判断。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q15-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>await</code> 会阻塞主线程吗？</strong> 不会，它只挂起当前函数并把控制权交回事件循环；但 <code>await</code> 右侧的表达式本身是同步求值的。</li>\\n<li><strong>多个 <code>await</code> 为什么变慢？</strong> 串行等待把延迟相加；只要能并发，就应先发起再统一等待。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://v8.dev/blog/fast-async\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">V8 async 优化</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":701}},{"id":16,"slug":"question-16","title":"Promise 链的值与错误如何传播？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","Promise"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>解释派生 Promise、返回值、thenable、抛错、缺少 handler 与异步清理如何影响链的状态。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q16-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>then</code>、<code>catch</code>、<code>finally</code> 每次都返回<strong>新的 Promise</strong>，新 Promise 的状态由回调的返回值或抛错决定；没有对应处理器的状态会沿链向后穿透。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q16-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>回调返回普通值 → 新 Promise fulfilled 为该值。</li>\\n<li>回调返回 Promise 或 thenable → 新 Promise 采用它的最终状态（会等待）。</li>\\n<li>回调抛错 → 新 Promise rejected。</li>\\n<li>缺少对应 handler → 状态与原因直接穿透到下一个匹配的处理器。</li>\\n<li><code>finally</code> 不改变原值与原拒绝原因，但它在抛错或返回 rejected Promise 时<strong>会覆盖</strong>原结果。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\"><span class=\\"hljs-params\\">x</span> =></span> x + <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> { <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Error</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'x'</span>) })\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">catch</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">10</span>)\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">finally</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">20</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 返回的 20 被忽略，finally 不改变结果</span>\\r\\n  .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">console</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">log</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 10</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q16-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>catch 处理器正常返回普通值或 fulfilled thenable 才恢复成功；处理器缺失、再次 throw、返回 rejected Promise 都继续拒绝。只想记日志时应重新 throw。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>在 <code>then</code> 里忘记 <code>return</code> 会产生\\"火忘\\"式并发，错误逃出当前链，变成 <code>unhandledrejection</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>finally</code> 里做异步清理必须 <code>return</code>，否则链不会等待清理完成。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>.catch</code> 也属于 handler，它里面再抛错会让新 Promise 变成 rejected；<code>catch</code> 不是\\"错误终点\\"。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>p.then(success, failure) 中 failure 接不住同次 success 抛错；p.then(success).catch(failure) 才能覆盖后者。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>new Promise(async executor) 是反模式：构造器忽略 executor 返回的 Promise，await 后异常可能与外层脱离，使外层永远 pending。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q16-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>Promise.reject(e).then(fn)</code> 会执行 fn 吗？</strong> 不会，缺少 onRejected 时直接穿透到下一个 catch 或全局兜底。</li>\\n<li><strong>怎么保证错误一定能被观测？</strong> 每条异步链路都要有归属：能处理的就地处理，不能处理的补上下文后抛出，并在应用边界统一上报。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-properties-of-the-promise-prototype-object\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Promise 方法</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":751}},{"id":17,"slug":"question-17","title":"Promise.all/allSettled/race/any 如何选择？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","Promise"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>比较结果条件、输入顺序、空 iterable、非法输入及取消，分别为全量汇总、最快结束与首个成功选择 API。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q17-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>按\\"需要什么结果语义\\"来选：结果缺一不可用 <code>all</code>，需要逐项成败全量汇总用 <code>allSettled</code>，只关心最快结束用 <code>race</code>，只关心第一个成功用 <code>any</code>。四者都<strong>不会取消</strong>其余任务。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q17-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>all</code>：全部 fulfilled 才 fulfilled；任一 rejected 立即 rejected（其余任务仍在跑，结果被丢弃）。</li>\\n<li><code>allSettled</code>：等全部 settled，返回 { status, value | reason } 数组；单个输入拒绝变成 reason，但非法 iterable、迭代过程抛错仍可让聚合 Promise 拒绝。</li>\\n<li><code>race</code>：第一个 settled 决定结果，成功或失败都可能赢，常用于超时竞争。</li>\\n<li><code>any</code>：第一个 fulfilled 即成功；全部 rejected 时以 <code>AggregateError</code> 拒绝。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> results = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">allSettled</span>(urls.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">map</span>(fetchJson))\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> ok = results.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">filter</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\"><span class=\\"hljs-params\\">r</span> =></span> r.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">status</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fulfilled'</span>).<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">map</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\"><span class=\\"hljs-params\\">r</span> =></span> r.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>)\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q17-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>空数组的边界：<code>all</code>/<code>allSettled</code> 立即 fulfilled 为 <code>[]</code>，<code>race</code> 永远 pending，<code>any</code> 立即以 <code>AggregateError</code> 拒绝。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>忽略结果不等于取消：AbortController / AbortSignal.timeout 可通知支持取消的请求停止等待或传输；不保证撤销服务端已经开始的工作，更不代表关闭整个复用连接。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>all 快速失败不取消其他任务；它已给正常迭代到的输入注册拒绝处理器，因此随后拒绝不会仅因聚合器已失败就自动触发 unhandledrejection，独立派生链仍需处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>手写实现必须<strong>按输入顺序</strong>写回结果（用索引赋值），不能 <code>push</code>，否则顺序会随完成时间变化。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>all / allSettled 结果及 AggregateError.errors 按输入顺序排列。空 iterable 可使返回 Promise 已落定，之后注册的 then / catch 仍异步执行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>这些 API 消费 iterable，不负责调用函数数组；传入 [() => fetch(url)] 得到的是函数值。限流需控制任务启动时机（见第 88 题）。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q17-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>超时该用 <code>race</code> 还是 <code>AbortSignal.timeout</code>？</strong> 优先 abort：<code>race</code> 只是忽略结果，不释放底层资源。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>AggregateError</code> 怎么取失败原因？</strong> 遍历 <code>error.errors</code>；用 <code>all</code> 则拿不到全部失败，需要改用 <code>allSettled</code> 自行聚合。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-properties-of-the-promise-constructor\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Promise 聚合</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":800}},{"id":18,"slug":"question-18","title":"并发与并行有什么区别？JavaScript 是单线程吗？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","并发"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>以单个 agent 为单位区分并发/并行，说明宿主 I/O、Worker、时间切片和共享内存对响应性与耗时的影响。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q18-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>并发指多个任务在时间上交错推进（可以只有一个执行单元）；并行指多个任务在同一时刻、不同执行单元上真正同时运行。同一 JavaScript agent 通常遵循 run-to-completion；多个 Worker / agent 可同时执行 JS，「单线程」必须限定到一个 agent，不能泛指整个应用。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q18-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>网络 I/O、部分栅格化与 GC 工作可由宿主其他线程/进程推进；HTML 解析、样式计算、布局等仍常占用主线程，不能断言这些步骤全在后台。</li>\\n<li><code>Web Worker</code>/<code>Service Worker</code> 提供独立的 JS 执行线程，通过 <code>postMessage</code> 与结构化克隆通信，默认不共享内存；<code>SharedArrayBuffer</code> + <code>Atomics</code> 才共享内存。</li>\\n<li>Node 侧对应 <code>worker_threads</code> 与 <code>cluster</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 看起来\\"异步\\"，但仍然是同步的 CPU 占用，会阻塞主线程</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\"><span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve</span> =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(resolve, <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>))\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">heavyLoop</span>()\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q18-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>把大循环包进 <code>Promise</code> 或 <code>setTimeout</code> <strong>不会</strong>让计算并行，Promise executor 本身立即同步执行；setTimeout 延后执行，二者中的计算都可能阻塞所在 agent。</li>\\n<li>Promise 的\\"并发\\"指同时发起、等待结果，与多线程并行无关。</li>\\n<li>时间切片（周期性让出事件循环）主要改善响应性，调度可能增加总耗时；Worker 移走主线程计算，能否降低完成耗时取决于并行程度与通信成本。</li>\\n<li>渲染与 JS 共享主线程，长任务会直接恶化 INP 与动画流畅度。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q18-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>什么时候值得用 Worker？</strong> CPU 密集、数据可序列化、不需要频繁访问 DOM 时；同时要把拷贝与通信成本算进收益。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>SharedArrayBuffer</code> 为什么需要跨源隔离？</strong> 它允许真正共享内存，需要 COOP/COEP 响应头来降低 Spectre 类侧信道风险。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":844}},{"id":19,"slug":"question-19","title":"Iterator 与 Generator 解决什么问题？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>区分 Iterator 与 Iterable，解释 Generator 惰性启动、next/yield、提前收尾、异步遍历及重复遍历条件。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q19-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>Iterator 是\\"逐步取值\\"的统一协议；Generator 提供了创建可暂停函数并自动实现该协议的语法，用来表达惰性序列、状态机与自定义遍历行为。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q19-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>Iterator 协议</strong>：对象有 <code>next()</code>，返回 <code>{ value, done }</code>。</li>\\n<li><strong>Iterable 协议</strong>：对象有 <code>[Symbol.iterator]()</code> 方法返回 iterator；<code>for...of</code>、展开、解构、<code>Promise.all</code>、<code>yield*</code> 都在消费 iterable。</li>\\n<li>Generator 函数执行到 <code>yield</code> 暂停，<code>next(value)</code> 可把值送回函数，<code>return()</code>/<code>throw()</code> 可提前结束或注入错误。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span>* <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">range</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">start, end</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> i = start; i &#x3C; end; i++) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">yield</span> i\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n[...<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">range</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">4</span>)] <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// [1, 2, 3]</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>配合 <code>yield*</code> 委托给另一个 iterable，配合异步生成器 + <code>for await...of</code> 处理流式数据。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q19-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>数组的 <code>map</code>/<code>filter</code> 不消费迭代器协议；自定义 iterable 需要先转换，或自己实现惰性版本。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>常见数组迭代器 / Generator 有状态且不可重置；Iterable 能否重复遍历取决于每次 Symbol.iterator 是否返回新的 iterator。协议不能替所有自定义迭代器保证永久耗尽，应看具体契约。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>惰性求值会让副作用执行时机变得不直观（generator 函数体内的副作用只在取值时发生）；调用生成器函数本身不会执行函数体，但参数会立即求值。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>生成器不是异步的：它只提供暂停/恢复，异步能力要靠 async generator 或自行组合 Promise。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>for...of 因 break / return / 循环体抛错提前结束时，尝试调用 iterator.return() 收尾；Generator 可在 finally 释放资源。第一次 next(value) 的 value 不会成为首个 yield 的返回值。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q19-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>普通对象为什么不能用 <code>for...of</code>？</strong> 它默认不是 iterable，需要 <code>Object.entries()</code>/<code>Object.keys()</code> 或自己实现 <code>[Symbol.iterator]</code>。</li>\\n<li><strong>异步生成器有什么用？</strong> 分页流式取数、逐块处理流式响应，比一次性 <code>Promise.all</code> 更适合数据量大的场景。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":883}},{"id":20,"slug":"question-20","title":"Map、Set、WeakMap、WeakSet 如何选择？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>从键类型、比较、顺序、强弱引用、枚举、序列化与容量治理选择集合，并说明非注册 symbol 的边界。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q20-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code> 是强引用的键值集合与唯一值集合，可枚举、可遍历、有 <code>size</code>；<code>WeakMap</code>/<code>WeakSet</code> 弱持有<strong>对象或非注册 symbol</strong> 作为键，不可枚举，适合给对象挂元数据或做与对象生命周期绑定的缓存。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q20-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>Map</code> 的键可以是任意值，对象键按身份比较，保留插入顺序，键不会被字符串化——这与对象字面量有本质区别。</li>\\n<li><code>Set</code> 保存唯一值，<code>NaN</code> 视为相等，<code>0</code> 与 <code>-0</code> 视为同一值。</li>\\n<li><code>WeakMap</code> 的键必须是可被弱引用的值（普通对象、函数、非注册 symbol）；不能是字符串、数字等其他原始值，也不能是 Symbol.for() 注册的 symbol；非注册 symbol 本身仍是原始值。</li>\\n<li>不可枚举是刻意设计：暴露遍历就会暴露 GC 时机，而 GC 是非确定的。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> meta = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">WeakMap</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">track</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">el</span>) {\\r\\n  meta.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(el, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">clicks</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> }) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// el 被回收后，这条记录也自动消失</span>\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q20-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>WeakMap</code> <strong>不是\\"永不泄漏\\"</strong>：value 可以强引用大对象，key 在别处强可达时也不会被回收，且完全没有容量控制。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>WeakMap / WeakSet 无 clear 方法，也不能靠枚举实现 LRU；整体丢弃或替换集合引用可清除本层关联——需要容量控制时用 <code>Map</code> 加显式淘汰规则。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code> 是强引用，拿它当缓存就必须自己管容量与 TTL，否则就是泄漏源。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>序列化差异：<code>JSON.stringify(new Map())</code> 得到 <code>{}</code>，需要手动 <code>[...map]</code>；<code>structuredClone</code> 可以克隆 <code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Map 与 Set 都用 SameValueZero：NaN 命中，±0 相同，对象按身份。规范要求访问平均次线性，不保证任何引擎和所有输入下严格 O(1)。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q20-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>什么时候用 <code>Map</code> 而不是普通对象？</strong> 键类型不限、需要 <code>.size</code>、增删频繁、需要稳定插入顺序，或要避开原型链键名冲突时。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>WeakRef</code>/<code>FinalizationRegistry</code> 能当缓存用吗？</strong> 不能依赖：回收与回调时机都不确定，只能作为可选优化，不能承载正确性。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/keyed-collections.html#sec-weakmap-objects\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">WeakMap</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":928}},{"id":21,"slug":"question-21","title":"常见前端内存泄漏来源和排查方法是什么？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>设计重复进出页面的复现流程，从 heap 趋势、snapshot 与 retaining path 定位持有者，并排除正常缓存和工具噪声。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q21-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>泄漏的本质是：本该被回收的对象<strong>仍然被强引用可达</strong>。前端最常见的两类成因是生命周期没有收尾，以及只增不减的缓存。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q21-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<p>常见来源：</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>未卸载的全局监听（<code>window</code>/<code>document</code>）、未清理的定时器与 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code>。</li>\\n<li><code>ResizeObserver</code>/<code>IntersectionObserver</code>/<code>MutationObserver</code> 未 <code>disconnect()</code>。</li>\\n<li>事件总线、全局 store、WebSocket 的订阅未取消。</li>\\n<li>只增不减的 <code>Map</code>/数组缓存、没有容量上限的 memo。</li>\\n<li>闭包捕获大对象、detached DOM 仍被 JS 引用。</li>\\n<li>未 abort 的请求回调持有组件状态（配合竞态处理，见第 43 题）。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>排查闭环：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>定义可重复操作，例如\\"进入/退出页面 20 次\\"。</li>\\n<li>用 Performance Monitor 观察 JS heap、DOM node、listener 数的趋势。</li>\\n<li>采集两到三次 heap snapshot，用 Comparison 视图看 retained size 的增量。</li>\\n<li>从 Retaining path 反查强引用链，定位真正的持有者。</li>\\n<li>修掉 cleanup 或补上淘汰策略，用同一流程复测确认基线回落。</li>\\n</ol>\\n"},{"id":"q21-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>内存短暂上涨<strong>不能</strong>直接判定泄漏：GC 时机不确定，判据应是\\"重复同一操作后基线不回落\\"。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>detached</code> 节点持续增长是强信号，但节点只有仍被 JS 引用时才会 detached 后继续存活。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>开发模式下的 HMR、Strict Mode 双执行、浏览器扩展都会造成噪声，尽量在生产构建下测量。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>只修症状（例如手动清空缓存）而不切断持有链，问题通常会换一种形式回来。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>DevTools console、被选中的 DOM 节点与调试变量也可能保留对象，测量时排除工具影响；有限请求结束后能释放引用的增长与持续泄漏应区分。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q21-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>怎么区分泄漏和正常缓存？</strong> 缓存应该有容量上限或淘汰策略；重复操作后观察基线是否回到同一水平。</li>\\n<li><strong>React 里最典型的泄漏点？</strong> 订阅与定时器没有在 Effect cleanup 中释放，以及持续请求流未取消。会结束的请求暂时持有闭包通常是生命周期或竞态问题，不能只凭卸载后有回调断定永久泄漏。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/devtools/memory-problems\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">DevTools 内存排查</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":973}},{"id":22,"slug":"question-22","title":"ESM 与 CommonJS 的核心差异是什么？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","ESM"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>比较依赖解析、加载、导出绑定与循环依赖，并说明浏览器 ESM 和现代 Node 的 CJS/ESM 互操作条件。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q22-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>核心差异在<strong>时机</strong>与<strong>绑定语义</strong>：ESM 是静态模块语法，依赖关系在执行前即可解析，导入是 live binding；CommonJS 是运行时包装函数，<code>require</code> 同步加载并返回当时的 module.exports 值；若是对象，双方共享对象，不能理解成内容快照或自动拷贝。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q22-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>语法与位置：ESM 的 <code>import</code>/<code>export</code> 只能出现在模块顶层，会被提升；CJS 的 <code>require</code> 可写在任意位置，按执行顺序同步加载。</li>\\n<li>绑定语义：ESM 导入的是<strong>活绑定</strong>，导出方后续更新，导入方能读到新值（但不能重新赋值）；CJS 拿到的是一次求值结果，重新赋值 <code>module.exports</code> 不会影响已经导入方持有的旧引用。</li>\\n<li>静态分析：ESM 的结构让 tree shaking 与循环依赖分析更可行；CJS 需要运行时推断，容易整包保留。</li>\\n<li>环境判定：浏览器原生只支持 ESM；Node 根据 type、.mjs/.cjs 等判定模块格式，并用 exports 条件选择入口；部分版本还会对未明确标记的 .js 检测模块语法。条件名本身不直接改变文件格式。</li>\\n<li>其他差异：ESM 支持 top-level await、默认严格模式、顶层 <code>this</code> 为 <code>undefined</code>；CJS 顶层 <code>this</code> 是 <code>module.exports</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q22-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>\\"用了 ESM 就一定能 tree shaking\\"是错的：顶层副作用、错误的 <code>sideEffects</code> 声明、整包聚合导入、依赖只发布 CJS 都会让消除失败（见第 82 题）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>循环依赖不一定立即报错：ESM 先建立绑定，访问尚未初始化的绑定会抛 TDZ 错误；CJS 常见到执行未完成时的\\"部分导出\\"。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>双包发布要小心 <code>exports</code> 条件顺序与\\"同一模块被加载两次\\"，后者会导致 <code>instanceof</code> 失效、单例重复。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>现代 Node 支持 require 加载满足条件且整个依赖图不含 top-level await 的同步 ESM，通常返回模块命名空间；带 TLA 的图需 import()。旧 Node 与工具链能力不同，应查目标版本文档。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>ESM 活绑定不可被导入方重新赋值，导出对象内容仍可变化；CJS exports 起初只是 module.exports 别名，exports = newValue 不会替换真正导出。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q22-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>静态 <code>import</code> 与 <code>import()</code> 的区别？</strong> 动态导入在运行时执行、返回 Promise，可用于条件加载与代码分割（见第 58 题）。</li>\\n<li><strong>怎么消除循环依赖？</strong> 重构模块边界，把共享部分抽成第三个模块，或用依赖注入替掉反向依赖。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://nodejs.org/api/modules.html#loading-ecmascript-modules-using-require\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Node require(esm)</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1023}},{"id":23,"slug":"question-23","title":"防抖和节流有什么区别？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>定义 leading/trailing、cancel/flush 与窗口语义，比较搜索、滚动和拖拽的选择，解释为何防抖不能解决竞态。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q23-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>防抖把\\"连续触发\\"收敛为静默后的一次执行；节流按约定窗口或相邻间隔限制频率，窗口边界与 leading / trailing 需明确。前者关心\\"最后一次\\"，后者关心\\"稳定节奏\\"。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q23-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>防抖</strong>：每次触发都重置计时器，停止触发一段时间后才执行；适合搜索输入、表单校验、窗口尺寸变化后的重算。</li>\\n<li><strong>节流</strong>：窗口内最多执行一次，常见形态是\\"首次立即执行 + 尾部补一次\\"；适合滚动位置、resize、拖拽、埋点上报。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">debounce</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, wait</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> timer\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...args</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> fn.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>, args), wait)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>完整实现还需要 <code>cancel</code>/<code>flush</code>、透传 <code>this</code> 与参数、以及在组件卸载时清理。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q23-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>防抖<strong>不解决竞态</strong>：慢的旧响应仍可能后到并覆盖新结果，必须额外用 <code>AbortController</code> 或请求序号（见第 43 题）。</li>\\n<li>组件卸载时必须 <code>cancel</code>，否则定时器会在组件消失后触发更新、或长期持有旧闭包造成泄漏。</li>\\n<li>leading/trailing 语义要显式定义并写测试，否则会出现\\"首次没反应\\"或\\"停止后不再更新\\"。</li>\\n<li>Date.now 可能受系统时钟调整影响，测量间隔优先使用单调的 performance.now；定时器也会受调度/节流延迟影响，不能保证更平滑或精确。</li>\\n<li>touch / wheel 在不需 preventDefault 时可用 passive，但它不降低回调计算量；scroll 等不可取消事件不靠 passive 提速。DOM 测量与写入应分批。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q23-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>搜索框应该用哪个？</strong> 通常防抖 + 请求取消；若要\\"输入即筛选本地数据\\"，节流或 <code>useDeferredValue</code> 更合适。</li>\\n<li><strong>和 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code> 的关系？</strong> rAF 不会合并多次注册；配合 pending 标志只注册一次，才能每帧最多更新一次，适合与渲染同步的更新，但不保证固定间隔（后台标签页会暂停）。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1062}},{"id":24,"slug":"question-24","title":"事件委托为什么有效？有什么边界？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>解释 target/currentTarget、closest 与范围校验，给出委托代码，分析不冒泡事件、Shadow DOM 与 stopPropagation。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q24-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>事件委托利用事件冒泡：把众多子元素的监听收敛到共同祖先，再用 <code>event.target.closest()</code> 定位真正被点击的元素。它同时减少监听器数量，并天然覆盖后来插入的节点。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q24-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>冒泡路径由 DOM 树决定，祖先上的监听器可以接住任意后代触发的事件。</li>\\n<li><code>event.target</code> 是实际触发元素，<code>event.currentTarget</code> 是绑定监听器的元素，委托时用前者定位、后者做范围校验。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\">list.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'click'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">event</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!(event.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">target</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">instanceof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Element</span>)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> button = event.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">target</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">closest</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'[data-action]'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!button || !list.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">contains</span>(button)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 关键：确认仍在容器内</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">run</span>(button.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">dataset</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">action</span>)\\r\\n})\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q24-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>并非所有事件都冒泡：<code>focus</code>/<code>blur</code>（需用 <code>focusin</code>/<code>focusout</code>）、<code>mouseenter</code>/<code>mouseleave</code>、<code>load</code> 等不冒泡，部分只能在捕获阶段处理。</li>\\n<li>Shadow DOM 可能重定向 target，composed 决定能否按规则穿越边界；composedPath() 可检查开放 shadow root 的路径，closed root 内部不会完整暴露。</li>\\n<li><code>closest</code> 可能命中容器之外的祖先，必须用 <code>contains</code> 校验，否则嵌套组件会误触发。</li>\\n<li>滥用 <code>stopPropagation</code> 会破坏其他委托逻辑（模态框、埋点、埋点外的关闭行为），优先用条件判断替代。</li>\\n<li>React 17 起把事件监听挂在根容器而不是 <code>document</code> 上，跨根节点与 Portal 的冒泡行为需要注意（见第 52 题）。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q24-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么说委托\\"自动覆盖新节点\\"？</strong> 监听器不在子节点上，新增节点无需重新绑定。</li>\\n<li><strong>大量同类元素怎么进一步优化？</strong> 委托到容器 + 虚拟化列表；先测量监听器、DOM 数量和回调计算成本；委托降低注册开销，不消除大型 DOM 与重计算。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-dispatch\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">DOM 事件分发</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1107}},{"id":25,"slug":"question-25","title":"为什么不可变更新对 React 很重要？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","React"],"estimatedMinutes":5,"promptHtml":"<p>解释 Object.is、逐项 props/依赖比较与快照，演示只复制变化路径，分析深拷贝及原地修改的代价。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q25-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>不可变更新不是 JavaScript 的语言要求，而是一条更新纪律。变化路径的新引用让 React 的 Object.is 状态和依赖比较观测到变更；memo 默认逐项比较 props，不做整棵对象深比较，同时保留旧快照，为并发渲染、撤销、调试提供前提。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q25-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 错误：原地修改后传回同一个引用</span>\\r\\nuser.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">name</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'B'</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">setUser</span>(user)\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 正确：只复制变化路径</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">setUser</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\"><span class=\\"hljs-params\\">prev</span> =></span> ({ ...prev, <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">name</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'B'</span> }))\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>useState</code> 的更新 bailout 使用 <code>Object.is</code> 比较，传入同一引用会被判定为无变化。</li>\\n<li><code>memo</code>、<code>useMemo</code>、<code>useEffect</code> 的依赖比较同样依赖引用稳定；原地修改会让\\"依赖没变所以跳过\\"的判断失效。</li>\\n<li>旧快照不可变，才使并发渲染下的可中断与重放结果可预期。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q25-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>深拷贝整棵树既慢，又破坏未变化分支的引用稳定性，可能让接收这些引用的 memo 边界失去收益。正确做法是<strong>只复制从根到变更点的路径</strong>。</li>\\n<li>嵌套更新容易漏层（<code>{ ...prev, a: { ...prev.a, b: 1 } }</code>），可用 <code>useReducer</code> 集中管理，或用 immer 类工具生成结构共享结果。</li>\\n<li>与 class 组件的 <code>setState</code> 不同，<code>useState</code> 不做浅合并，必须自己展开。</li>\\n<li>不可变不等于\\"每层都复制\\"：未变化的分支必须沿用原引用，以保留这些分支的引用稳定与缓存收益。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q25-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么并发渲染更依赖不可变？</strong> 渲染可能被中断后重放，若状态被原地修改，渲染读到的就不是同一份快照。</li>\\n<li><strong>什么时候可以接受可变？</strong> 纯计算的局部变量、<code>useRef</code> 持有的非渲染数据，以及明确不参与渲染的缓存。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1151}},{"id":26,"slug":"question-26","title":"前端错误应该怎样分类和传播？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>区分校验、业务、鉴权、HTTP、网络、取消与程序错误，定义传播、重试、UI 恢复及上报的职责。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q26-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>先按\\"能否重试、谁能处理、用户该看到什么\\"分类，再为每类定义统一的传播与提示策略。核心原则：错误要么在本层被处理，要么补上下文后继续向上，绝不能静默吞掉。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q26-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<p>至少区分：用户输入校验错误、业务拒绝（库存不足、状态不允许）、认证与授权错误、网络与超时、限流、服务端错误、程序 bug。每类都要定义：是否重试、是否提示用户、是否保留旧数据、日志级别、恢复到哪一步。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">ApiError</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">extends</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_ inherited__\\">Error</span> {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">constructor</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">message, { code, status, retryable } = {}</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">super</span>(message)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">name</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'ApiError'</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">code</span> = code\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">status</span> = status\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">retryable</span> = retryable\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>传播路径：网络层标准化为带 <code>code</code>/<code>status</code> 的错误对象 → 数据层（query/mutation）决定重试与缓存失效 → 路由或组件边界决定 UI → 上报层补齐上下文（release、route、requestId）。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q26-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>空的 <code>catch {}</code> 是最严重的反模式：错误被吞掉，线上只剩\\"点了没反应\\"。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>当前层无法处理时要补充上下文后重新抛出，而不是就地 <code>console.log</code> 后返回一个假成功。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>window.onerror</code> 与 <code>unhandledrejection</code> 只是最后一道观测网，拿不到业务上下文，不能替代局部处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>Error Boundary 覆盖后代渲染及相应生命周期等错误，普通事件处理器、定时器、请求 Promise 的拒绝需自行处理（见第 53 题的版本与 Actions 边界）。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>toast 不能作为唯一错误 UI：可能被忽略，也无法承载重试入口。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>日志必须脱敏，不上报手机号、token、完整请求体等个人信息。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>fetch 遇到 HTTP 4xx / 5xx 通常仍 fulfilled，需检查 response.ok / status；网络失败、取消、解析失败与业务拒绝应分别归类。主动取消或过期结果通常无需 toast。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>不能把所有 5xx 视为可重试，应结合幂等性、服务端契约、重试预算与 Retry-After；new Error(message, { cause: original }) 可保留原始原因与堆栈链。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q26-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>怎么避免同一错误刷屏？</strong> 按错误指纹（message + stack + code）聚合计数与采样上报。</li>\\n<li><strong>重试策略怎么定？</strong> 只对幂等且可恢复的类型（网络抖动、超时、5xx）做指数退避加抖动，其余直接暴露给用户。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-method\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Fetch 标准</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1193}},{"id":27,"slug":"question-27","title":"垃圾回收可以手动触发吗？WeakRef 应该用来解决普通缓存吗？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","缓存"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>区分不可达与立即回收，说明弱引用非确定性与 kept-alive 保证，为普通缓存和外部资源设计确定策略。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q27-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>业务代码不能可靠地控制 GC 时机（<code>globalThis.gc()</code> 只在特定调试模式或 Node 的 <code>--expose-gc</code> 下存在），<code>WeakRef</code> 与 <code>FinalizationRegistry</code> 的回收和回调时机同样不确定，因此不能承载正确性、关键资源释放或普通业务缓存策略。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q27-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>现代引擎采用分代加增量/并发标记清除，回收时机由内存压力与空闲时间决定。</li>\\n<li>deref() 可能返回 undefined；成功解引用后，目标在规范 kept-alive job 范围内不会被回收，不能说同一同步执行中随时消失。FinalizationRegistry 回调可能永不运行。</li>\\n<li>需要释放的资源（连接、订阅、文件句柄、Worker）必须显式 <code>close()</code>/<code>unsubscribe()</code>/<code>terminate()</code>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> meta = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">WeakMap</span>() <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 跟随对象生命周期，适合对象级元数据</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>普通缓存的正确做法是明确策略：容量上限 + 淘汰规则（LRU/LFU）+ TTL + 主动失效。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q27-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\"内存会涨\\"不等于泄漏：先确认重复操作后基线是否回落（见第 21 题）。</li>\\n<li>kept-alive 保证不粗略等同事件循环一轮；跨异步边界再次 deref 必须重新检查。若跨 await 使用已取得的目标，保存在局部变量并继续引用可形成强引用。</li>\\n<li>用 <code>FinalizationRegistry</code> 做资源清理会形成\\"有时不执行\\"的泄漏，属于设计错误。</li>\\n<li>调试手段（DevTools Memory/Performance、<code>--expose-gc</code>）只用于本地验证，不应出现在产品逻辑里。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q27-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>WeakMap</code> 能当缓存吗？</strong> 它是\\"跟随对象生命周期的关联存储\\"，没有容量与淘汰语义，只能算缓存的一个特例。</li>\\n<li><strong>什么可以依赖 GC？</strong> 自动管理普通 JS 对象内存；不可达不保证立即回收，外部资源仍应显式释放。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/managing-memory.html#sec-weak-ref-objects\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">WeakRef</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1245}},{"id":28,"slug":"question-28","title":"为什么 Array.prototype.sort 可能带来 React bug？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","React"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>分析原地排序对 props/state 的影响，给出不可变写法，并说明默认排序、稳定性、比较器与浅复制的边界。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q28-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>因为 <code>sort</code> 是<strong>原地修改</strong>：它会直接改动 React 正在持有的 props 或 state 数组，破坏状态快照与引用比较的前提（见第 25 题）。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q28-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 错误：原地排序，state 数组本身已被改动</span>\\r\\nitems.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sort</span>(compare)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">setItems</span>(items) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 同一引用，更新可能被跳过</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 正确：先复制再排序</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> sorted = [...items].<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sort</span>(compare)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 现代运行环境也可以直接用 items.toSorted(compare)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>同类的原地方法还有 <code>reverse</code>、<code>splice</code>、<code>fill</code>、<code>copyWithin</code>、<code>push</code>/<code>pop</code>/<code>shift</code>/<code>unshift</code>。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q28-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p>原地排序后再 <code>setItems(items)</code> 传入同一引用，会被 <code>Object.is</code> 判定为无变化而跳过渲染——数据变了但 UI 不刷新。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>破坏快照的影响不止少渲染一次：并发渲染、撤销、<code>memo</code> 比较、其他消费者读到的旧数据都会受影响。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>sort</code> 默认按字符串比较，数字数组必须传比较函数，否则 <code>[10, 9]</code> 的结果不符合直觉。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>ES2019 起 <code>sort</code> 是稳定的，但稳定不代表可以省略比较函数，也不代表可以原地调用。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><code>toSorted</code>/<code>toReversed</code>/<code>toSpliced</code> 需要较新的运行环境，兼容性不足时用 <code>[...arr]</code> 兜底。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>比较器需保持一致结果、相等、反对称与传递性，不用 Math.random() 或只返回 0 / 1；(a, b) => a - b 适合有效数值，NaN / 空值需定义位置。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p>稳定排序只表示相等元素维持相对顺序，不保证时间/空间复杂度；复制数组仍共享元素对象，比较器应避免修改元素。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q28-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>只排序不 setState 可以吗？</strong> 不可以，会污染父组件或其他消费者共享的数据，属于跨组件副作用。</li>\\n<li><strong>团队层面怎么防？</strong> 约定\\"渲染输入只读\\"，在 code review 与 lint 层面禁止修改入参。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/indexed-collections.html#sec-array.prototype.sort\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">数组排序</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":1286}},{"id":86,"slug":"question-86","title":"实现 debounce，支持 cancel 和 flush","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","debounce"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 trailing-only 的 <code>debounce(fn, wait)</code>：连续调用只在停止至少 <code>wait</code> 毫秒后执行最后一次，保留实参与 <code>this</code>。<code>wait</code> 为非负整数毫秒数；<code>cancel()</code> 丢弃尚未执行的调用，<code>flush()</code> 立即执行待处理调用并返回其结果，无待处理调用时返回 <code>undefined</code>。需允许 <code>fn</code> 内再次调用该包装函数。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q86-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用一个定时器和最后一次调用信息实现尾部防抖。执行前先把参数取到局部变量并清空旧状态，才能让回调中的重入创建独立的新一轮任务。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q86-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">debounce</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, wait</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fn must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isInteger</span>(wait) || wait &#x3C; <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> || wait > <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span> ** <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">31</span> - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'wait must be a supported non-negative delay'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> lastArgs\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> lastThis\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">invoke</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (timer === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> args = lastArgs\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> thisArg = lastThis\\r\\n    lastArgs = lastThis = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> fn.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(thisArg, args)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">debounced</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...args</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (timer !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    lastArgs = args\\r\\n    lastThis = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(invoke, wait)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  debounced.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">cancel</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (timer !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    lastArgs = lastThis = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  debounced.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">flush</span> = invoke\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> debounced\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q86-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>flush()</code> 后旧定时器被清除；若 <code>fn</code> 重入，不能在 <code>fn</code> 返回后再次清空参数或定时器，否则会误删新任务。<code>cancel()</code> 无法中断已开始执行的函数或请求。</li>\\n<li>包装函数的普通调用返回 <code>undefined</code>；只有 <code>flush()</code> 返回本次执行结果。若 <code>fn</code> 返回 Promise，调用方需要处理其 rejection；定时器路径的同步异常也需要业务层明确处理，不能静默吞掉。</li>\\n<li><code>wait = 0</code> 仍是异步定时器任务。定时器会受任务队列、最小延迟和后台限速影响，不能保证精确在指定毫秒执行。<a href=\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/timers-and-user-prompts.html#timers\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">HTML 定时器规范</a></li>\\n<li>每次调用调度开销 O(1)，额外空间 O(k)，k 是最后一次实参数量及其引用；这里只实现 trailing，不包含 leading/maxWait。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q86-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何支持 maxWait？</strong> 另外记录本轮首次触发时间和最大等待期限；持续输入时仍需按最大期限执行，并与普通尾部定时器一起取消。</li>\\n<li><strong>搜索只做 debounce 够吗？</strong> 它减少请求触发频率，已发请求仍可能乱序；还需取消或最新请求标记，见第 94 题。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":3883}},{"id":87,"slug":"question-87","title":"实现 throttle，支持 trailing","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","throttle"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>throttle(fn, wait)</code>，<code>wait</code> 为正整数毫秒数：首次立即执行，之后相邻执行间隔至少为 <code>wait</code>；窗口内多次调用合并为一次 trailing，使用最后一次实参与 <code>this</code>。提供 <code>cancel()</code>，取消后下一次调用视为首次。需处理回调重入。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q87-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用单调时钟记录最近执行时间，未到期限时只安排一个尾部定时器。执行前清理当前批次，既保留最后一次调用信息，也不会覆盖回调重入产生的新批次。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q87-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throttle</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, wait</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fn must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isInteger</span>(wait) || wait &#x3C;= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> || wait > <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span> ** <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">31</span> - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'wait must be a supported positive delay'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> lastInvokeTime = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> lastArgs\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> lastThis\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">invoke</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">now</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (timer !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    lastInvokeTime = now\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> args = lastArgs\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> thisArg = lastThis\\r\\n    lastArgs = lastThis = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> fn.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(thisArg, args)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">schedule</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> remaining = wait - (performance.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">now</span>() - lastInvokeTime)\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n      timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (performance.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">now</span>() - lastInvokeTime &#x3C; wait) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">schedule</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">invoke</span>(performance.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">now</span>())\\r\\n    }, <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">max</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>, remaining))\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throttled</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...args</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> now = performance.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">now</span>()\\r\\n    lastArgs = args\\r\\n    lastThis = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (lastInvokeTime === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> || now - lastInvokeTime >= wait) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">invoke</span>(now)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (timer === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">schedule</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  throttled.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">cancel</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (timer !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    lastInvokeTime = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    lastArgs = lastThis = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> throttled\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q87-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>用 <code>null</code> 表示从未执行，不能假定时间戳初值 <code>0</code> 一定早于当前时间一个窗口。<code>performance.now()</code> 基于单调时钟，避免系统挂钟调整影响间隔。<a href=\\"https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dom-performance-now\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">High Resolution Time</a></li>\\n<li>只有窗口内确实出现新调用才补 trailing；一次孤立调用只执行一次。定时器可能晚到；回调中重查期限避免毫秒取整导致提前执行。</li>\\n<li>立即执行的调用返回 <code>fn</code> 结果，合并的调用返回 <code>undefined</code>。回调重入会在新窗口排队；<code>cancel()</code> 无法撤销已发生的副作用。</li>\\n<li>调度时间 O(1)，额外空间 O(k)，不计 <code>fn</code>；与渲染帧同步的视觉更新可选择 <code>requestAnimationFrame</code>，它不保证指定的毫秒限流间隔。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q87-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>leading 和 trailing 都开启会执行两次吗？</strong> 孤立调用不会；首次之后窗口内有额外调用时，才执行尾部合并调用。</li>\\n<li><strong>节流能防止慢请求堆积吗？</strong> 不能。它限制发起频率，不限制在途数量；需要并发限制器或取消策略。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":3949}},{"id":88,"slug":"question-88","title":"实现并发限制器 mapLimit","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","并发"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>mapLimit(items, limit, mapper)</code>：输入是调用期间不被修改的数组，<code>limit</code> 是正整数；<code>mapper(item, index)</code> 可返回普通值或 Promise，也可能同步抛错。按输入顺序返回结果；首个被观察到的失败使整体拒绝，并停止领取新任务，但不要求取消已启动任务。空数组返回 <code>[]</code>。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q88-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>启动至多 <code>limit</code> 个 worker，通过同步游标领取下标，任务完成后立即补位。用共享失败标志停止后续调度，并按原下标存放结果。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q88-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">mapLimit</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">items, limit, mapper</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(items)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'items must be an array'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isInteger</span>(limit) || limit &#x3C;= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid limit'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> mapper !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'mapper must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> length = items.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> results = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>(length)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> nextIndex = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> stopped = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">worker</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">while</span> (!stopped) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> index = nextIndex++\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (index >= length) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n        results[index] = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">mapper</span>(items[index], index)\\r\\n      } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n        stopped = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> error\\r\\n      }\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">all</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">from</span>({ <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">length</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">min</span>(limit, length) }, <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">worker</span>()))\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> results\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q88-section-2","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>调度总工作 O(n)，结果空间 O(n)，同时至多 <code>min(limit, n)</code> 个 mapper 在途；实际耗时取决于任务时长和下游资源。</li>\\n<li>同步的游标领取在同一个 JavaScript agent 中不会被另一个 worker 的 continuation 打断；这不是跨线程共享内存锁。</li>\\n<li>分批 <code>Promise.all</code> 会等整批最慢任务再补位，worker 模式利用率更高。<code>Promise.all([])</code> 合法且 fulfilled 为 <code>[]</code>，空数组无歧义。<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-promise.all\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript Promise.all</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q88-section-3","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>fail-fast 只描述返回 Promise；已启动任务仍可能完成或产生副作用。停止标志只能阻止失败被观察到之后的新领取。</li>\\n<li>输入若已是启动中的 Promise，限制 mapper 的并发不会限制它们的执行；任务必须按需在 mapper 内启动。稀疏数组的空位按 <code>undefined</code> 处理。</li>\\n<li>若需要取消，把 <code>AbortSignal</code> 传给 mapper 并让其合作响应；若需要所有结果，改为记录每个下标的 fulfilled/rejected 状态，而非直接拒绝。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q88-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能完成后直接 push？</strong> 那会按完成顺序排列，破坏与输入下标的对应关系。</li>\\n<li><strong>如何选择 limit？</strong> 根据接口限流、连接数和任务资源占用测量；提高并发并不保证更快。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4027}},{"id":89,"slug":"question-89","title":"手写 Promise.all","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","Promise"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现返回原生 Promise 的 <code>promiseAll(iterable)</code>。接受有限的同步 iterable，元素可以是普通值、Promise 或 thenable；保持输入顺序，空 iterable 返回 <code>[]</code>，元素拒绝或迭代抛错时拒绝。非 iterable（包括只有 <code>length</code> 的 array-like）应拒绝。不要求支持 Promise 子类或被改写的原生方法。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q89-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>同步遍历输入并立即给每个元素注册处理器，用下标保存结果，用剩余计数决定完成。计数初始为 1 作为“遍历尚未结束”的哨兵，避免把空输入或收集中途当成已完成。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q89-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">promiseAll</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">iterable</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve, reject</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> results = []\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> remaining = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> index = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> iterable) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> currentIndex = index++\\r\\n      results.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>)\\r\\n      remaining += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(value).<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">result</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n          results[currentIndex] = result\\r\\n          remaining -= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (remaining === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(results)\\r\\n        },\\r\\n        reject,\\r\\n      )\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    remaining -= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (remaining === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(results)\\r\\n  })\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q89-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>for...of</code> 要求同步 iterable，不能用 <code>Array.from</code> 无条件替代：后者还接受非 iterable 的 array-like，甚至会把 <code>{}</code> 当作空数组，改变错误契约。</li>\\n<li>迭代器抛错发生在 Promise executor 内，会转成 rejection；已经取出的元素已注册 rejection handler。thenable 的访问、采用和值归一交给原生 <code>Promise.resolve</code>。</li>\\n<li>空输入返回的 Promise 当场 fulfilled，但 <code>.then</code> 回调仍异步执行；非空普通值输入也经 Promise reactions 完成。</li>\\n<li>第一个使聚合 Promise settle 的 rejection 生效，其他任务不会取消；迭代器中同步抛出的错误可能先于已拒绝元素的 reaction 生效。<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-promise.all\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript Promise.all 算法</a></li>\\n<li>这是教学实现，不复刻原生方法的构造器泛型调用、iterator record 全部细节或原生方法被改写后的行为；无限 iterable 会同步阻塞。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q89-section-3","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<p>遍历与收集 O(n)，空间 O(n)，不计任务本身；拒绝时不必等最慢任务，只有全部成功时才等待全部完成。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q89-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能看 <code>results.length</code>？</strong> 结果槽在收集时已分配，长度表示输入数量，不表示成功完成数量。</li>\\n<li><strong>Promise.all 会启动任务吗？</strong> 它消费并聚合输入；普通 Promise 通常在创建时已经开始执行，生成器也可能在迭代时创建任务。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4089}},{"id":90,"slug":"question-90","title":"实现 EventEmitter","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现同步 <code>EventEmitter</code>，提供 <code>on</code>、<code>off</code>、<code>once</code>、<code>emit</code>。同一事件重复注册同一函数去重；按注册顺序调用，监听器的 <code>this</code> 是 emitter。<code>emit</code> 固定本轮快照；期间新增监听器留到下一轮，移除的普通监听器仍可在本轮执行。<code>once</code> 在嵌套 emit 下也最多执行一次；监听器异常向调用方传播并中断本轮。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q90-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用 <code>Map&#x3C;type, Set&#x3C;listener>></code> 保存注册顺序，emit 遍历快照。once 除了执行前退订，还要有已执行标记：嵌套 emit 可能先消费它，而外层快照仍持有同一个 wrapper。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q90-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">EventEmitter</span> {\\r\\n  #events = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">on</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">type, listener</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> listener !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid listener'</span>)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> listeners = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#events.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(type) ?? <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>()\\r\\n    listeners.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">add</span>(listener)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#events.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(type, listeners)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">off</span>(type, listener)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">once</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">type, listener</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> listener !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid listener'</span>)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> fired = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> off = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">on</span>(type, <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...args</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (fired) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n      fired = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">off</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> listener.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>, args)\\r\\n    })\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> off\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">off</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">type, listener</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> listeners = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#events.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(type)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!listeners) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n    listeners.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(listener)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (listeners.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">size</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#events.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(type)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">emit</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">type, ...args</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> listeners = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#events.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(type)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!listeners) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> listener <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> [...listeners]) listener.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>, args)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q90-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>快照是本题选择的变更语义，不能笼统说“删除 Set 元素一定会跳过后续元素”。直接遍历还会观察迭代期间的新增项，才是此处要避免的行为。</li>\\n<li>两次 <code>once(type, fn)</code> 创建两个 wrapper，属于两个独立的一次性注册；使用返回的退订函数删除各自 wrapper。本实现不支持通过 <code>off(type, fn)</code> 删除 once 注册。</li>\\n<li><code>emit</code> 同步执行，不等待 async listener。async listener 的 rejection 需要调用方另定捕获策略；不要假装同步 try/catch 能捕获 Promise rejection。</li>\\n<li>普通监听器递归 emit 可无限递归；once 守卫只保护 once，并不限制其他监听器。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q90-section-3","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<p>典型 Map/Set 实现下注册、移除为平均 O(1)；emit 时间与快照空间均 O(k)，k 为本事件监听器数。此处是自定义契约，不能当作 Node.js EventEmitter 或 DOM EventTarget 的完整替代。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q90-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>要隔离监听器异常怎么办？</strong> 对每个同步 listener 单独捕获并收集错误，明确 emit 的返回/抛错策略；async 版本则需显式 await 或汇总 Promise。</li>\\n<li><strong>如何支持重复注册？</strong> 用数组或独立注册 token，使每次注册有独立身份，并定义 off 是移除一次还是全部。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4150}},{"id":91,"slug":"question-91","title":"实现 O(1) 的 LRU Cache","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","LRU"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现按条数淘汰的 LRU Cache：容量是正整数；<code>get(key)</code> 命中时刷新最近使用顺序，未命中返回 <code>undefined</code>；<code>set</code> 写入/覆盖也刷新顺序，超过容量淘汰最久未用项。允许任意 Map key 和 <code>undefined</code> value，提供 <code>has</code> 区分未命中。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q91-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>利用 Map 的插入顺序，命中或覆盖时先删后插，把该 key 移到末尾。容量溢出时移除迭代顺序里的第一个 key；O(1) 是通常哈希表实现下的平均复杂度假设，不是 ECMAScript 对 Map 的严格保证。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q91-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">LRUCache</span> {\\r\\n  #capacity\\r\\n  #cache = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">constructor</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">capacity</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isInteger</span>(capacity) || capacity &#x3C;= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'capacity must be a positive integer'</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#capacity = capacity\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">key</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(key)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">key</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(key)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(key)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(key)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(key, value)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> value\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">key, value</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(key)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(key, value)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">size</span> > <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#capacity) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">keys</span>().<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">next</span>().<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q91-section-2","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>典型引擎下 get/set 以平均 O(1) 分析，空间 O(capacity)。标准要求 Map 平均访问时间随元素数次线性增长，并未承诺严格或摊还 O(1)，也不规定 <code>keys().next()</code> 的复杂度。<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/keyed-collections.html#sec-map-objects\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript Map</a></li>\\n<li>经典“哈希表 + 双向链表”方案把查找和使用顺序显式分开，适合实现 TTL、按权重淘汰；同样需要说明哈希表复杂度假设。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q91-section-3","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>has</code> 不刷新顺序；<code>get</code> 才刷新。本题缺失和缓存 <code>undefined</code> 都返回 <code>undefined</code>，调用方可配合 <code>has</code> 判断。</li>\\n<li>普通对象也有标准化属性顺序，但整数索引会特殊排序，并且普通对象 key 仅为 string/symbol；不能说“对象完全没有顺序”。Map 可区分 <code>1</code> 与 <code>'1'</code>，对象 key 按引用区分。</li>\\n<li>容量按条数不等于内存上限；缓存对象及 Promise 都有资源占用。TTL 和请求去重需要另外设计。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q91-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么覆盖时不能只调用 Map.set？</strong> 已存在 key 的 set 不会把它移动到末尾，必须先 delete。</li>\\n<li><strong>如何添加 TTL？</strong> 每条记录保存 expiresAt，get 时先检查过期再刷新 LRU；还应明确惰性清理或主动扫描策略。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4223}},{"id":92,"slug":"question-92","title":"实现支持循环引用的 deepClone","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>deepClone</code>，支持同一 realm 的普通对象（Object.prototype 或 null 原型）、普通数组、Date、RegExp、Map、Set，以及循环/共享引用。保留自有属性描述符、symbol/不可枚举属性、数组空洞和 RegExp.lastIndex；getter/setter 保留函数引用而不调用。函数值、类实例、内置类型子类及其他宿主/内置对象均不在支持范围，显式报错；输入不是 Proxy，不改写内置方法。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q92-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>深拷贝处理的是对象图：先按支持类型分配副本并登记原对象到副本的映射，再递归内容。Date/RegExp 同样必须登记，否则同一个实例被多次引用时会错误生成多个副本；仅复制原型不能制造带有正确内部槽的任意对象。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q92-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepClone</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value, seen = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">WeakMap</span>()</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Functions are not supported'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> || value === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> value\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (seen.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(value)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> seen.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(value)\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> proto = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(value)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> result\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span> || proto === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) result = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">create</span>(proto)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(value) &#x26;&#x26; proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) result = []\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Date</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) result = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Date</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Date</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">getTime</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">call</span>(value))\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RegExp</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> source = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getOwnPropertyDescriptor</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RegExp</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'source'</span>).<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">get</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">call</span>(value)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> flags = [\\r\\n      [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'hasIndices'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'d'</span>], [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'global'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'g'</span>], [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'ignoreCase'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'i'</span>], [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'multiline'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'m'</span>],\\r\\n      [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'dotAll'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'s'</span>], [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'unicode'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'u'</span>], [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'unicodeSets'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'v'</span>], [<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'sticky'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'y'</span>],\\r\\n    ].<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">map</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">[key, flag]</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> getter = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getOwnPropertyDescriptor</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RegExp</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>, key)?.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">get</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> getter?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">call</span>(value) ? flag : <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">''</span>\\r\\n    }).<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">join</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">''</span>)\\r\\n    result = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RegExp</span>(source, flags)\\r\\n  } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) result = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) result = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Unsupported object type'</span>)\\r\\n\\r\\n  seen.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(value, result)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> [key, item] <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">entries</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">call</span>(value)) {\\r\\n      result.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepClone</span>(key, seen), <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepClone</span>(item, seen))\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> item <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">values</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">call</span>(value)) result.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">add</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepClone</span>(item, seen))\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> key <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Reflect</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">ownKeys</span>(value)) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> descriptor = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getOwnPropertyDescriptor</span>(value, key)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'value'</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">in</span> descriptor) descriptor.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepClone</span>(descriptor.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>, seen)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">defineProperty</span>(result, key, descriptor)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isExtensible</span>(value)) <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">preventExtensions</span>(result)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> result\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q92-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>所有支持类型都递归复制自有属性；Map 的 key 也复制，因此原 key 无法直接查到克隆后的对象 key，但克隆图内部的共享关系保留。</li>\\n<li>Accessor 函数和它捕获的闭包仍共享；不触发 getter 不等于把闭包状态深拷贝。只复制私有字段类的原型会得到不可用的伪实例，所以本题拒绝类实例。</li>\\n<li>本实现不支持跨 realm 内置对象、ArrayBuffer/TypedArray、WeakMap/WeakSet、Promise、Error、DOM 等。普通 Proxy 无可靠通用检测，此处按输入契约排除。</li>\\n<li><code>structuredClone</code> 对循环、Map/Set、buffer 等数据提供平台支持，但不能保留本题要求的自定义描述符/原型语义，也不能克隆函数。应先确定克隆契约再选择工具。<a href=\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/structured-data.html#structuredserializeinternal\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">HTML 结构化序列化</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q92-section-3","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<p>按通常弱映射查找成本，时间 O(V + E)，映射空间 O(V)，递归栈 O(depth)，V/E 是对象图节点与属性/集合边数。循环被解决仍不等于极深嵌套不会栈溢出；超深数据需显式栈。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q92-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么一定要先 seen.set 再递归？</strong> 自引用或互引用需要立即找到尚未填完的副本，否则无限递归。</li>\\n<li><strong>必须用 WeakMap 吗？</strong> 一次调用内的局部 Map 也正确，调用结束可释放；WeakMap 的弱引用有利于映射长时间保留时不延长原对象生命周期，不是算法正确性的前提。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4291}},{"id":93,"slug":"question-93","title":"实现带 AbortSignal 和指数退避的 retry","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>retry(task, options)</code>：<code>task({ attempt, signal })</code> 可同步抛错或返回 Promise；retries 为非负安全整数，表示首次之后的额外尝试次数。只重试 <code>shouldRetry(error, attempt)</code> 明确允许的失败，使用有上限的指数退避和 jitter。取消等待时清理定时器及 abort listener；取消后不再尝试，也不接受迟到成功。task 的在途取消由 task 合作实现。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q93-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>把可取消等待、尝试次数和重试判定分开。abort reason 可以是任何 JavaScript 值，不能只看 <code>error.name</code>；等待成功和取消两条路径都要移除监听器。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q93-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sleep</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">ms, signal</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve, reject</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n    signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> timer\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">cleanup</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) => {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n      signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">removeEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, onAbort)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">onAbort</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) => {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">cleanup</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(signal.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">reason</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    timer = <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">cleanup</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n    }, ms)\\r\\n    signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, onAbort, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">once</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span> })\\r\\n  })\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">retry</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">task, options = {}</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> {\\r\\n    retries = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">3</span>, baseDelay = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">200</span>, maxDelay = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">30000</span>, signal,\\r\\n    shouldRetry = <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">error</span>) =></span> error?.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">retryable</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>,\\r\\n  } = options\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> task !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span> || <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> shouldRetry !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'task and shouldRetry must be functions'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isSafeInteger</span>(retries) || retries &#x3C; <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid retries'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (![baseDelay, maxDelay].<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">every</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">n</span>) =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">isFinite</span>(n) &#x26;&#x26; n >= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> &#x26;&#x26; n &#x3C;= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span> ** <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">31</span> - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid delay'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> attempt = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>; attempt &#x3C;= retries; attempt++) {\\r\\n    signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">task</span>({ attempt, signal })\\r\\n      signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> value\\r\\n    } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n      signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (attempt === retries || !<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">shouldRetry</span>(error, attempt)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> error\\r\\n      signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> cap = baseDelay === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> ? <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> : <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">min</span>(maxDelay, baseDelay * <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span> ** attempt)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sleep</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">random</span>() * cap, signal)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q93-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>{ once: true }</code> 仅在 abort 发生时自动移除，正常完成仍需主动清理。预先 aborted 的 signal 要立即拒绝，且保留自定义 reason。<a href=\\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-abortsignal\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">DOM AbortSignal</a></li>\\n<li>task 忽略 signal 且永不 settle 时，retry 也无法立即结束；若需要返回 Promise 立即拒绝，另做 abort race，并仍持续处理底层拒绝与资源释放。</li>\\n<li>fetch 对 HTTP 429/5xx 通常仍 fulfilled；task 必须检查 response.ok，把可重试错误显式标记。参数、认证和业务错误不应默认重试。</li>\\n<li>重试写操作要有服务端幂等契约；网络错误不代表服务端没执行。退避不应超过服务端 Retry-After 或业务总时限的约束。</li>\\n<li>示例是 full jitter（0 到 cap），maxDelay 限制单次等待，不限制总耗时；任务时限和总 deadline 需要独立设计。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q93-section-3","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<p>最多 retries + 1 次调用，调度额外空间 O(1)；总耗时为任务执行与等待之和，不能仅由指数公式保证。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q93-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何区分总超时与用户取消？</strong> 用不同 reason 标识；支持时可组合 AbortSignal.timeout/any，但超时策略和重试次数仍要清楚区分。</li>\\n<li><strong>shouldRetry 可以异步吗？</strong> 此版本必须同步返回 boolean；若改成异步判定，需要 await，并在判定后重新检查取消。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4367}},{"id":94,"slug":"question-94","title":"实现\\"只采用最新请求结果\\"","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","请求"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>createLatestRunner()</code>，返回 <code>run(task)</code>：启动新调用时取消旧调用，task 接收本次的 AbortSignal。每个 run 返回 <code>{ status: 'success', value }</code>、<code>{ status: 'error', error }</code> 或 <code>{ status: 'stale' }</code>；过期调用的成功和拒绝都归为 stale。提供 <code>run.cancel()</code> 使当前调用失效，并考虑 abort listener 引发重入。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q94-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>取消用来尽力释放资源，版本号决定结果是否有效。每次调用必须捕获自己的 controller，不能在 catch 中读取已经被后一次调用替换的共享实例。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q94-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">createLatestRunner</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> version = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> controller = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">run</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">task</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> currentVersion = ++version\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> currentController = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">AbortController</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> previous = controller\\r\\n    controller = currentController\\r\\n    previous?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">abort</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (currentVersion !== version) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'stale'</span> }\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">task</span>(currentController.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (currentVersion !== version || currentController.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">aborted</span>) {\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'stale'</span> }\\r\\n      }\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'success'</span>, value }\\r\\n    } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (currentVersion !== version || currentController.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">aborted</span>) {\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'stale'</span> }\\r\\n      }\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'error'</span>, error }\\r\\n    } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">finally</span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (controller === currentController) controller = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  run.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">cancel</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n    version += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> previous = controller\\r\\n    controller = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>\\r\\n    previous?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">abort</span>()\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> run\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q94-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>abort 会触发监听器；先发布新 controller 再取消旧 controller，并在取消后重查 version，避免重入覆盖最新任务。</li>\\n<li>task 同步抛错、拒绝和成功均经过 try/catch；不要只在成功分支判 stale，否则旧请求失败也会污染错误状态。</li>\\n<li>task 不支持取消时仍可判 stale，但它必须先 settle，旧 run 才能返回；版本号不能让永不完成的任务自动结束。<a href=\\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#aborting-ongoing-activities\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">DOM 取消语义</a></li>\\n<li>run 只判定返回时的有效性；调用方只提交 success/error，并在额外异步处理之后再次考虑是否过期。工具不能撤销 task 内已经执行的写操作。</li>\\n<li>每次 run 的管理成本 O(1)，在途任务数量取决于底层是否合作取消，不能笼统称总空间 O(1)。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q94-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 finally 也要检查 controller 身份？</strong> 旧任务结束时直接清空共享 controller，会破坏新任务的取消能力。</li>\\n<li><strong>组件卸载怎么处理？</strong> cleanup 调用 run.cancel；仅在输入变化时启动新 run，不能覆盖卸载路径。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4452}},{"id":95,"slug":"question-95","title":"数组转树与树转数组","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>arrayToTree(items)</code> 与 <code>flattenTree(roots)</code>。id 为非空字符串或有限数字且唯一；parentId 为父 id，null/undefined 表示根。允许多根，保持输入中的兄弟顺序；重复 id、缺失父节点或环应报错。flatten 采用前序遍历，按实际树结构输出 parentId（根归一为 null），去掉 children，并拒绝循环和重复节点。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q95-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>数组转树先建索引，再沿父链做访问状态校验，最后挂接。树转数组用显式栈维持前序顺序，并记录已见对象/id，避免循环或共享节点被误当成合法树。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q95-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">validId</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">id</span>) =>\\r\\n  (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> id === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'string'</span> &#x26;&#x26; id.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span> > <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) ||\\r\\n  (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> id === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'number'</span> &#x26;&#x26; <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">isFinite</span>(id))\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">arrayToTree</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">items</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(items)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'items must be an array'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> nodes = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> item <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> items) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!item || !<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">validId</span>(item.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>) || (item.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">parentId</span> != <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> &#x26;&#x26; !<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">validId</span>(item.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">parentId</span>))) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid id or parentId'</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (nodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(item.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Error</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Duplicate id'</span>)\\r\\n    nodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(item.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>, { ...item, <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">children</span>: [] })\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> state = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> id <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> nodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">keys</span>()) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> path = []\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> current = id\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">while</span> (current != <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> &#x26;&#x26; state.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(current) !== <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (state.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(current) === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Error</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Cycle detected'</span>)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> node = nodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(current)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!node) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Error</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Missing parent'</span>)\\r\\n      state.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(current, <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)\\r\\n      path.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(current)\\r\\n      current = node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">parentId</span>\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> visited <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> path) state.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(visited, <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> roots = []\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> node <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> nodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">values</span>()) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">parentId</span> == <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) roots.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(node)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> nodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">parentId</span>).<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">children</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(node)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> roots\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">flattenTree</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">roots</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(roots)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'roots must be an array'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> result = []\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> seenNodes = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> seenIds = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Set</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> stack = roots.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">map</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">node</span>) =></span> ({ node, <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">parentId</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> })).<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reverse</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">while</span> (stack.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> { node, parentId } = stack.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">pop</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!node || !<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">validId</span>(node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'invalid node'</span>)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (seenNodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(node) || seenIds.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Error</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Cycle or duplicate node'</span>)\\r\\n    seenNodes.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">add</span>(node)\\r\\n    seenIds.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">add</span>(node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span>)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> { children = [], ...rest } = node\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(children)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'children must be an array'</span>)\\r\\n    result.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>({ ...rest, parentId })\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> i = children.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span> - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>; i >= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>; i--) {\\r\\n      stack.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>({ <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">node</span>: children[i], <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">parentId</span>: node.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">id</span> })\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> result\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q95-section-2","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<p>按典型 Map/Set 成本且每节点载荷字段数有界，两者时间 O(n)、额外空间 O(n)。父链检查在已完成节点处停止，每个节点不会被反复完整遍历；显式栈也避免深层递归栈溢出。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q95-section-3","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>只有环、没有根的输入也必须报错；从 roots 开始校验会漏掉整段不可达的环。</li>\\n<li>输出节点是新对象，原节点顶层字段修改不会同步影响树；嵌套载荷仍共享引用，这是浅拷贝而不是完整深克隆。</li>\\n<li>输出顺序是前序，不保证还原原数组的全局排列。children 字段会按结构生成/去除；父节点结构由 flatten 重新推导。</li>\\n<li>一棵树不允许一个对象属于两个父节点；若业务需要共享子节点，应建模为 DAG，并另定遍历/去重语义。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q95-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能边遍历边只找已有父节点？</strong> 子节点可能先于父节点出现；先完整建索引才能处理任意输入顺序。</li>\\n<li><strong>找不到父节点应作为根吗？</strong> 可以选择这种容错契约，但必须显式返回诊断；本题采用严格报错，避免静默改写结构。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4521}},{"id":96,"slug":"question-96","title":"实现 compose","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现同步、单参数函数的 <code>compose(...functions)</code>，满足 <code>compose(f, g, h)(x) = f(g(h(x)))</code>。空函数列表返回 identity；非函数参数在创建时抛错，不要求传递 this 或自动 await Promise。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q96-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>compose</code> 从右到左把上一层结果交给下一层函数，<code>reduceRight</code> 正好表达这个顺序；带初始值的空列表自然得到 identity。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q96-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">compose</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...functions</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (functions.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">some</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn</span>) =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>)) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'compose expects functions'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">input</span>) =></span> functions.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reduceRight</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value, fn</span>) =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">fn</span>(value), input)\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">trim</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) => value.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">trim</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">lower</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) => value.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">toLowerCase</span>()\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">slug</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) => value.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">replaceAll</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-regexp\\">/\\\\s+/g</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'-'</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">compose</span>(slug, lower, trim)(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'  Hello World  '</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 'hello-world'</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">compose</span>()(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">42</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// 42</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q96-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>本题是同步单参契约；某函数返回 Promise 时，左侧函数收到的是 Promise 对象，不会自动等待。函数异常立即向调用方传播。</li>\\n<li>如果扩展多参，应是最右侧、最先被调用的函数接收 <code>...args</code>，其他函数接收单个前一步结果，不能含糊地说“第一个函数”。</li>\\n<li><code>pipe(f, g)(x)</code> 从左到右，是 <code>g(f(x))</code>。函数组合不同于带 next 和控制权转移的中间件组合。</li>\\n<li>n 个函数的组合开销 O(n)、额外计算空间 O(1)，不计函数本身；闭包存储函数列表需要 O(n)。<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/indexed-collections.html#sec-array.prototype.reduceright\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript reduceRight</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q96-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何支持异步串行组合？</strong> 返回 async 函数，从右到左循环 <code>value = await fn(value)</code>，统一同步/异步返回；错误向外拒绝。</li>\\n<li><strong>TypeScript 如何保证相邻签名匹配？</strong> 用有界重载或递归可变元组校验前一个输出能作为下一个输入；简单 <code>Function[]</code> 无法提供这一保证。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4616}},{"id":97,"slug":"question-97","title":"实现并解释大数金额相加","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现人民币最小单位“分”的任意精度相加及展示。输入为 bigint 或规范十进制整数字符串，可为负；禁止先接收可能已失真的 Number。输出相加结果的 bigint，以及固定两位小数的元字符串，例如 <code>formatCents(addCents('10', '20')) === '0.30'</code>。不要求计算税率或币种转换。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q97-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>金额用最小单位整数运算，大整数始终保存在 BigInt 中；展示时也用整数除法和余数拼接字符串。把大额 cents 转为 Number 再除以 100，会在最后一步重新丢失精度。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q97-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">parseCents</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'bigint'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> value\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'string'</span> || !<span class=\\"hljs-regexp\\">/^-?(0|[1-9]\\\\d*)$/</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">test</span>(value)) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'cents must be bigint or an integer string'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">BigInt</span>(value)\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addCents</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">a, b</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">parseCents</span>(a) + <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">parseCents</span>(b)\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">formatCents</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> cents = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">parseCents</span>(value)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> sign = cents &#x3C; <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0n</span> ? <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'-'</span> : <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">''</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> absolute = cents &#x3C; <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0n</span> ? -cents : cents\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">\`<span class=\\"hljs-subst\\">\${sign}</span><span class=\\"hljs-subst\\">\${absolute / <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">100n</span>}</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-subst\\">\${<span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">String</span>(absolute % <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">100n</span>).padStart(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'0'</span>)}</span>\`</span>\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">formatCents</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addCents</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'9007199254740991'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'1'</span>)) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// '90071992547409.92'</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">formatCents</span>(-<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1n</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// '-0.01'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q97-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER 是 <code>9007199254740991</code>；按分存储对应 <code>90071992547409.91</code> 元。输入超过安全范围后再执行 <code>BigInt(number)</code> 无法恢复之前已经丢失的位。<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/numbers-and-dates.html#sec-number.max_safe_integer\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript MAX_SAFE_INTEGER</a></li>\\n<li>即使每个 Number 输入都安全，和也可能超过安全范围；本题从输入到展示都避免这种问题。BigInt 不能与 Number 混合算术，JSON 默认不能序列化 BigInt，传输时用约定的整数字符串。</li>\\n<li>本题已明确“两位小数的人民币分”；多币种需携带单位精度，不能把所有币种除以 100。</li>\\n<li>十进制元字符串应逐位解析为分，并明确超出两位时拒绝还是舍入；不要 <code>parseFloat(value) * 100</code>。乘除、税率和分摊需单独定义舍入与尾差规则。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q97-section-3","title":"复杂度与取舍","html":"\\n<p>设输入位数为 d，解析、相加和文本输出通常按 O(d) 分析，空间 O(d)；BigInt 运算不是与位数无关的 O(1)。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q97-section-4","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 toFixed(2) 不解决计算问题？</strong> 它只格式化已有的浮点值，无法保证此前计算和大整数转换都保持精度。</li>\\n<li><strong>能直接用 Intl.NumberFormat 吗？</strong> BigInt 的整数展示可用它；含小数的大金额是否能用精确十进制字符串取决于目标环境支持，应验证，不应无条件先转 Number。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":4660}},{"id":151,"slug":"question-151","title":"为什么 forEach(async ...) 不等待？串行、并发和限流如何选择？","category":"javascript","type":"theory","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["async/await","Promise","数组遍历"],"estimatedMinutes":6,"promptHtml":"<p>解释下面函数为什么可能先返回空数组，以及回调异常为何不能被外层捕获。分别给出保持输入顺序的串行、并发方案，并说明何时必须限流。</p>\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">load</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">items</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> results = []\\r\\n  items.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">forEach</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> item => {\\r\\n    results.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">fetchItem</span>(item))\\r\\n  })\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> results\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>","answerSections":[{"id":"q151-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>forEach 同步调用各个回调，但忽略回调返回值，因此不会等待 async 回调的 Promise；load 自身也没有 await 这些任务。串行用 for...of + await，并发用 Promise.all(items.map(...))，限流则控制任务函数的启动数量（见第 88 题）。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q151-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">serial</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">items, fetchItem</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> results = []\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> item <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> items) results.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">fetchItem</span>(item))\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> results\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">concurrent</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">items, fetchItem</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">all</span>(items.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">map</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> item => <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">fetchItem</span>(item)))\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>串行适合后一项依赖前一项或服务端要求顺序的流程；并发适合彼此独立且规模受控的任务。Promise.all 按输入顺序输出，不按完成顺序输出；原例的 push 则跟随完成顺序。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q151-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>原例把可变数组提前返回，后续回调仍可能继续修改它；即使某次控制台看到了填充后的数组，也不能证明 load 等待了所有任务。</li>\\n<li>async 回调的拒绝不会由 forEach 传播，外面的同步 try/catch 接不住；返回聚合 Promise 或逐项 await，让错误有归属。</li>\\n<li>map(async ...) 得到 Promise 数组，await 数组本身不会等待数组元素。filter(async ...) 会把 Promise 对象当 truthy，不能据此异步筛选。</li>\\n<li>用 async 包裹 map 回调，可把 mapper 的同步 throw 转成对应 Promise 拒绝，避免 map 在 Promise.all 注册处理器前中断。Promise.all 不会限流，也不会因首个失败自动取消其余任务；海量请求用任务队列，业务允许部分成功时用 allSettled。</li>\\n<li>Promise.all 接受稀疏数组时，迭代到的空位按 undefined 处理；forEach / map 则跳过没有属性的数组索引，输入契约应避免隐式依赖空位。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q151-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<p><strong>必须并发但逐项处理错误怎么办？</strong> 使用 allSettled，按输入索引关联结果，再分别展示成功、失败与重试；若需串行但不中断，用循环内 try/catch 收集每项状态。</p>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/indexed-collections.html#sec-array.prototype.foreach\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript forEach</a>、<a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-promise.all\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Promise.all</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7215}},{"id":152,"slug":"question-152","title":"实现带超时与外部取消的异步任务包装器","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["Promise.race","AbortController","超时"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 withTimeout(task, ms, { signal }?)，task 接收包装器自己的 AbortSignal。超时或外部取消时，包装器应及时拒绝并通知任务；即使任务忽略 signal 也不能让调用方无限等待。成功、失败、取消后都要清理定时器与监听器。假设现代平台支持 AbortController、signal.reason 和 throwIfAborted。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q152-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>等待超时和取消底层工作是两件事：用拒绝分支参与 Promise.race 保证调用方停止等待，用 AbortSignal 通知配合取消的任务停止工作，并在 finally 释放定时器和监听器。若任务忽略 signal，其底层副作用仍可能继续。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q152-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">withTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">task, ms, { signal } = {}</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> task !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'task must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isInteger</span>(ms) || ms &#x3C;= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> || ms > <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span> ** <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">31</span> - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RangeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'ms must be a positive 32-bit timer delay'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> controller = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">AbortController</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">forwardAbort</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) => controller.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">abort</span>(signal.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">reason</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> onAbort\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> aborted = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">_, reject</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n    onAbort = <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(controller.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">reason</span>)\\r\\n    controller.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, onAbort, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">once</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span> })\\r\\n  })\\r\\n  signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, forwardAbort, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">once</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span> })\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> timer = <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n    controller.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">abort</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">DOMException</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Task timed out'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'TimeoutError'</span>))\\r\\n  }, ms)\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> work = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>().<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n      controller.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">task</span>(controller.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>)\\r\\n    })\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">race</span>([work, aborted])\\r\\n  } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">finally</span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n    signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">removeEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, forwardAbort)\\r\\n    controller.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">signal</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">removeEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, onAbort)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q152-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>task 的同步 throw、正常值与 Promise 都由 work 链统一接住；外部 signal 已取消时，不启动任务。</li>\\n<li>race 已为 work 注册拒绝处理器，超时后 work 的迟到拒绝不会仅因输掉竞争而成为未处理拒绝；任务自己创建的独立异步链仍需处理。</li>\\n<li>取消原因可以是任意值，不保证是名为 AbortError 的 Error；保留 signal.reason 比只判断 error.name 更准确。</li>\\n<li>浏览器定时器受长任务与后台节流影响，超时不是实时中断；task 中的同步大循环会阻塞超时回调，应通过 Worker 或分段计算解决。</li>\\n<li>signal 能让支持取消的 fetch 等操作停止等待或传输，不能撤销已在服务端发生的写操作；写入仍需服务端幂等与状态查询。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q152-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<p><strong>何时可用 AbortSignal.timeout / any？</strong> 支持这些 API 的目标环境中可以组合信号来简化通知；但忽略 signal 的任务仍需竞争拒绝分支。选型要确认兼容性及 timeout 的计时语义。</p>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-abortcontroller\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">DOM AbortController</a>、<a href=\\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/timers-and-user-prompts.html#timers\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">HTML timers</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7270}},{"id":153,"slug":"question-153","title":"原型污染如何发生？普通对象字典怎样处理不可信键？","category":"javascript","type":"scenario","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["原型链","安全","Map"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>外部 JSON 会被递归合并到默认配置。解释 <strong>proto</strong>、constructor.prototype 等路径的风险，区分 JSON.parse 本身与后续写入的行为，并给出字典与配置合并的防护策略。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q153-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>风险通常出在把不可信键当作属性路径递归读取/写入，最终改到目标对象原型或共享原型。解析 JSON 不等于已污染 Object.prototype；危险往往来自后续赋值、Object.assign 或递归合并。纯字典优先 Map 或无原型对象；配置应按允许字段重建并逐层校验。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q153-section-1","title":"原理与示例","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> input = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">JSON</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">parse</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'{\\"__proto__\\":{\\"theme\\":\\"demo\\"}}'</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">hasOwn</span>(input, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'__proto__'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true：JSON 的普通自身数据属性</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> dictionary = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">entries</span>(input))\\r\\ndictionary.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'__proto__'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// { theme: 'demo' }：只是普通 Map 键</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> record = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">create</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> [key, value] <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">entries</span>(input)) record[key] = value\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(record) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// null：此对象没有继承的 __proto__ setter</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>若把 input 赋值合并到普通对象，历史 <strong>proto</strong> setter 可能改变该目标的原型；递归合并沿 constructor.prototype 继续写入时，还可能碰到共享原型。对象自身原型被改与全局 Object.prototype 被污染，影响范围不同。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q153-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>使用 Object.hasOwn 判断自身属性；for...in 会包含继承的可枚举键，不能直接作为安全配置字段列表。</li>\\n<li>只过滤最外层 <strong>proto</strong> 不够。每一层都要验证允许的键和数据类型；不能把用户提供的点分路径直接映射到任意对象属性。</li>\\n<li>无原型对象只保护该字典的原型行为；之后把内容合并进普通对象仍需检查。对象展开采用创建数据属性语义，和 Object.assign 的目标 setter 行为不同，但浅复制也不能替代输入校验。</li>\\n<li>TypeScript 的 Record 类型没有运行时保护，Object.freeze 单个目标也不能保护别处的共享原型；库版本更新需结合官方修复说明和回归用例。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q153-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<p><strong>配置合并怎样更稳妥？</strong> 根据 schema 逐项读取明确允许的自身字段，验证类型与范围后创建新配置；对于任意用户键的业务数据使用 Map，避免将数据键解释成对象结构路径。</p>\\n<p>参考：<a href=\\"https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Prototype_Pollution_Prevention_Cheat_Sheet.html\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">OWASP 原型污染防护</a>。</p>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7334}},{"id":157,"slug":"question-157","title":"手写 call 与 apply","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","call","apply","this"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>callIt(fn, thisArg, ...args)</code> 与语义等价的 <code>applyIt(fn, thisArg, argsArray)</code>，让任意普通函数以指定 <code>this</code> 执行并返回结果。<code>applyIt</code> 的第三个参数可为 <code>null</code>/<code>undefined</code> 或类数组（有 <code>length</code>），不要求是真正的数组。说明为什么手写实现无法完全复刻原生 <code>call</code> 在严格模式下的 <code>this</code> 替换规则。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q157-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>把函数临时挂到目标对象上，用 <code>target.method()</code> 的形式调用，JavaScript 就会把 <code>target</code> 作为 <code>this</code>，调用完再删除该属性。用 <code>Symbol</code> 作为键可以避免覆盖目标对象上的同名属性。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q157-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">callIt</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, thisArg, ...args</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fn must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> key = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Symbol</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'thisArg'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> target = thisArg == <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> ? globalThis : <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>(thisArg)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">defineProperty</span>(target, key, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">value</span>: fn, <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">configurable</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span> })\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> target[key](...args)\\r\\n  } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">finally</span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">delete</span> target[key]\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">applyIt</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, thisArg, argsArray</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fn must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (argsArray == <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">callIt</span>(fn, thisArg)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">callIt</span>(fn, thisArg, ...<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">from</span>(argsArray))\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q157-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>原生 <code>call</code>/<code>apply</code> 不修改 <code>thisArg</code>；本实现要临时给目标对象加属性再删除。目标被 <code>Object.freeze</code>/<code>seal</code> 或不可扩展时会抛 <code>TypeError</code>，用 <code>Proxy</code> 还可能触发陷阱或访问器副作用。<code>Reflect.apply</code> 不碰目标对象，是更接近原生的做法。</li>\\n<li>严格模式的函数被 <code>call</code> 传入原始值时，<code>this</code> 保持原始值本身（<code>null</code>/<code>undefined</code> 也不替换）；非严格模式会装箱原始值，<code>null</code>/<code>undefined</code> 替换为全局对象。运行时没有可靠方式判断一个函数是否为严格模式，因此本实现只能按一种近似处理。</li>\\n<li>箭头函数没有自己的 <code>this</code>，<code>call</code>/<code>apply</code> 无法改变它；类构造函数必须用 <code>new</code> 调用，直接 <code>call</code> 会抛错。</li>\\n<li>原生 <code>apply</code> 的第二个参数可以是任意类数组对象（只要求有 <code>length</code>），而展开运算符只接受可迭代对象，所以这里用 <code>Array.from</code> 兜底。</li>\\n<li>这是教学近似实现；原生还涉及 <code>[[Call]]</code> 的 non-callable 检查与完整的 <code>this</code> 替换规则，见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/fundamental-objects.html#sec-function.prototype.apply\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript <code>Function.prototype.apply</code></a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q157-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不直接 <code>context.fn = fn</code>？</strong> 会覆盖 <code>thisArg</code> 上的同名属性且留下残留字段；用 <code>Symbol</code> 键基本避免覆盖，但仍会短暂改动对象并受 Proxy/冻结影响。<code>Reflect.apply(fn, thisArg, args)</code> 直接执行规范调用，不需要属性挂载。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>apply</code> 和 <code>call</code> 只是参数形式不同吗？</strong> 是；<code>apply</code> 多用一次数组参数的拆解，本质都是设定 <code>this</code> 并调用。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7511}},{"id":158,"slug":"question-158","title":"手写 bind","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","bind","new"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>myBind(fn, thisArg, ...presetArgs)</code>：返回的函数可继续接收参数并拼接在预设参数之后；以 <code>new</code> 调用返回的函数时忽略 <code>thisArg</code>，并让实例的原型指向 <code>fn.prototype</code>，使 <code>instanceof fn</code> 成立。说明为什么用箭头函数承载会失败。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q158-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>返回普通函数而不是箭头函数，才能同时具备普通调用与 <code>[[Construct]]</code> 两种行为。用 <code>new.target</code> 区分：普通调用走 <code>Reflect.apply</code> 绑定 <code>this</code>，<code>new</code> 调用走 <code>Reflect.construct</code>，由后者按规范设置实例原型。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q158-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">myBind</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, thisArg, ...presetArgs</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fn must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">bound</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...laterArgs</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> args = [...presetArgs, ...laterArgs]\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">target</span> ? <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Reflect</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">construct</span>(fn, args) : <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Reflect</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(fn, thisArg, args)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> bound\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">Point</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">x, y</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">x</span> = x\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">y</span> = y\\r\\n}\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">BoundPoint</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">myBind</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Point</span>, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">ignored</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span> }, <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> point = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">BoundPoint</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// { x: 1, y: 2 }</span>\\r\\npoint <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">instanceof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Point</span> <span class=\\"hljs-comment\\">// true</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q158-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>new.target</code> 只有在以 <code>new</code> 调用时才有值，用它区分两种调用方式。<code>Reflect.construct(fn, args)</code> 默认以 <code>fn</code> 作为 <code>newTarget</code>，实例原型即 <code>fn.prototype</code>，因此 <code>instanceof fn</code> 成立；<code>thisArg</code> 在 <code>new</code> 时被忽略。</li>\\n<li>嵌套 <code>bind</code> 的预设参数按绑定顺序从左到右拼接；<code>bound</code> 自身是普通函数，可继续被 <code>myBind</code>，也可被子类 <code>extends</code>。</li>\\n<li>原生的 bound 函数没有自己的 <code>prototype</code> 属性，<code>bound.prototype</code> 为 <code>undefined</code>；本实现返回的是普通函数，<code>bound.prototype</code> 存在，所以 <code>new bound() instanceof bound</code> 这类边界行为与原生不同（原生此处会因 <code>prototype</code> 非对象抛错）。</li>\\n<li><code>bind</code> 只预设参数与 <code>this</code>，不能改变箭头函数的 <code>this</code>；类构造函数 <code>bind</code> 后仍须用 <code>new</code> 调用。</li>\\n<li>原生还会设置 <code>name</code> 前缀 <code>bound </code>、令 <code>length</code> 为 <code>max(0, target.length - boundArgs.length)</code>、并在 <code>newTarget</code> 为绑定函数本身时把它替换为目标构造函数级联；本实现未复刻这些细节。见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/ordinary-and-exotic-objects-behaviours.html#sec-bound-function-exotic-objects-construct\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript Bound Function <code>[[Construct]]</code></a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q158-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能返回箭头函数？</strong> 箭头函数没有 <code>[[Construct]]</code>，<code>new</code> 会抛错，也无法用 <code>new.target</code> 区分调用方式。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>myBind</code> 和 <code>fn.bind</code> 还有哪些差异？</strong> <code>length</code>/<code>name</code>、<code>prototype</code> 属性、以及被当作 <code>newTarget</code> 时的级联替换；生产中直接使用 <code>Function.prototype.bind</code> 或 <code>Reflect.construct</code>。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7561}},{"id":159,"slug":"question-159","title":"模拟 new 运算符","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","new","prototype"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>myNew(Constructor, ...args)</code>，复刻 <code>new</code> 的关键步骤：按 <code>Constructor.prototype</code> 创建实例、以实例为 <code>this</code> 调用构造函数、依据返回值决定最终结果。说明构造函数返回原始值、返回对象时的差异，以及为什么该实现对 <code>class</code> 无效。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q159-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>new</code> 大致等于：创建一个原型为 <code>Constructor.prototype</code> 的对象，以它为 <code>this</code> 调用构造函数，若构造函数返回对象（或函数）则用该返回值，否则用新实例。<code>Object.create</code> 负责原型，<code>Function.prototype.apply</code> 负责以指定 <code>this</code> 调用。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q159-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">myNew</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">Constructor, ...args</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Constructor</span> !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Constructor must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> proto = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Constructor</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> instance = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">create</span>(\\r\\n    proto !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> &#x26;&#x26; (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> proto === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> || <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> proto === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>)\\r\\n      ? proto\\r\\n      : <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>,\\r\\n  )\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> result = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Constructor</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(instance, args)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> result !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> &#x26;&#x26; (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> result === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> || <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> result === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>)\\r\\n    ? result\\r\\n    : instance\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q159-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>构造函数返回原始值（含 <code>null</code>）时被忽略，<code>new</code> 表达式结果仍是新实例；返回对象或函数时，该返回值会替换掉新实例。</li>\\n<li><code>class</code> 构造函数不能用 <code>apply</code> 调用，会抛 “Class constructor cannot be invoked without 'new'”，因此本模拟对 <code>class</code> 无效。要正确地复刻 <code>new</code>，应使用 <code>Reflect.construct(Constructor, args)</code>，它执行规范的 <code>[[Construct]]</code>。</li>\\n<li>真实 <code>new</code> 会让构造函数内的 <code>new.target</code> 指向构造函数，本模拟用 <code>apply</code> 调用时 <code>new.target</code> 为 <code>undefined</code>；箭头函数、生成器函数没有 <code>[[Construct]]</code>，真实 <code>new</code> 会抛 <code>TypeError</code>，本模拟不会。</li>\\n<li><code>Constructor.prototype</code> 不是对象（含函数也没有默认 <code>prototype</code> 时）时，规范回退到 <code>Object.prototype</code>；这一分支要与“原型链继承”一并理解。</li>\\n<li><code>Object.create</code> 建立的实例决定着 <code>instanceof</code>、属性查找和方法调用。见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/ordinary-and-exotic-objects-behaviours.html#sec-ordinary-object-internal-methods-and-internal-slots-construct\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript <code>[[Construct]]</code></a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q159-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能直接 <code>return Constructor.apply({}, args)</code>？</strong> 缺少 <code>Object.create</code> 设置原型，实例无法继承 <code>Constructor.prototype</code>，<code>instanceof</code> 和原型方法都会失效。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>Reflect.construct</code> 与手写 <code>new</code> 的关系？</strong> <code>Reflect.construct</code> 是可调用的规范构造操作，能正确处理 <code>class</code>、<code>new.target</code> 和原型解析，是运行时复刻 <code>new</code> 的推荐方式。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7612}},{"id":160,"slug":"question-160","title":"手写 instanceof","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript","instanceof","prototype"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>myInstanceof(value, Constructor)</code>，沿 <code>value</code> 的原型链查找是否等于 <code>Constructor.prototype</code>。说明原始值输入、<code>Constructor.prototype</code> 非对象、以及自定义 <code>Symbol.hasInstance</code> 三种情况下的差异。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q160-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p><code>instanceof</code> 本质是原型链查找：从 <code>value</code> 的原型开始逐层向上，看是否遇到 <code>Constructor.prototype</code>。原始值没有原型链，直接返回 <code>false</code>。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q160-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">myInstanceof</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value, Constructor</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Constructor</span> !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'Right-hand side of instanceof is not callable'</span>)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (value === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> || (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> &#x26;&#x26; <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>)) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> target = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Constructor</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> proto = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(value)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">while</span> (proto !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (proto === target) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n    proto = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(proto)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q160-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>原始值（<code>number</code>/<code>string</code>/<code>boolean</code>/<code>symbol</code>/<code>bigint</code>）没有原型链，<code>1 instanceof Number</code> 原生也是 <code>false</code>，不会先装箱再判断。</li>\\n<li><code>Constructor.prototype</code> 不是对象时（如箭头函数），<code>target</code> 为 <code>undefined</code>，循环中永不相等，返回 <code>false</code>，与原生一致。</li>\\n<li>原生会先检查 <code>Constructor[Symbol.hasInstance]</code>；若自定义了该方法，判定可与原型链完全无关。本实现只做原型链查找，忽略 <code>Symbol.hasInstance</code>。</li>\\n<li>跨 realm（不同 iframe/worker）的 <code>Constructor.prototype</code> 属于另一个 realm，原型链通常对不上，<code>instanceof</code> 会返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\\n<li>沿链查找的时间复杂度 O(链长)，额外空间 O(1)。规范定义见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/abstract-operations.html#sec-ordinaryhasinstance\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">OrdinaryHasInstance</a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q160-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong><code>Object.create(null)</code> 的实例呢？</strong> 原型为 <code>null</code>，除非 <code>target</code> 恰好也是 <code>null</code>，否则返回 <code>false</code>。</li>\\n<li><strong>构造函数返回对象时 <code>instanceof</code> 会怎样？</strong> 最终结果对象可能不继承 <code>Constructor.prototype</code>，此时 <code>result instanceof Constructor</code> 为 <code>false</code>。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7660}},{"id":161,"slug":"question-161","title":"手写简化版 Promise","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","Promise","微任务"],"estimatedMinutes":15,"promptHtml":"<p>实现一个简化版 <code>MyPromise</code>，支持 <code>new MyPromise(executor)</code>、<code>then</code> 链式调用、状态单向流转（pending→fulfilled/rejected）、thenable 采纳和回调异步执行。成功回调的返回值应作为下一个 Promise 的履行值；回调抛错或返回被拒绝的 Promise 应向下传播。说明它相比原生 Promise 缺少哪些能力。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q161-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用一个状态机加一组待处理回调实现：<code>then</code> 注册回调并返回新 Promise，状态落定时通过微任务异步触发。<code>resolve</code> 负责采纳 thenable，<code>reject</code>/<code>resolve</code> 用状态守卫保证只 settle 一次，回调返回值经 <code>resolve</code> 递归解析形成链式。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q161-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">PENDING</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">FULFILLED</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">REJECTED</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">class</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">MyPromise</span> {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">constructor</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">executor</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> executor !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'executor must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">PENDING</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span> = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">handlers</span> = []\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">settle</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">state, value</span>) => {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> !== <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">PENDING</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> = state\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span> = value\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">queueMicrotask</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.#<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">flush</span>())\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">reason</span>) => <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">settle</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">REJECTED</span>, reason)\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) => {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> !== <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">PENDING</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (value <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">instanceof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">MyPromise</span>) {\\r\\n        value.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(resolve, reject)\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n      }\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (value !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> &#x26;&#x26; (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> || <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>)) {\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> then\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n          then = value.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">then</span>\\r\\n        } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(error)\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n        }\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> then === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) {\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">queueMicrotask</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> then.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">call</span>(value, resolve, reject))\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n        }\\r\\n      }\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">settle</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">FULFILLED</span>, value)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">executor</span>(resolve, reject)\\r\\n    } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(error)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  #<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">flush</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> handlers = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">handlers</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">handlers</span> = []\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> handle <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> handlers) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">handle</span>()\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">onFulfilled, onRejected</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">MyPromise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve, reject</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">handle</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) => {\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> callback = <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">FULFILLED</span> ? onFulfilled : onRejected\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> callback !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) {\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">FULFILLED</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>)\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>)\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n        }\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">callback</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>))\\r\\n        } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(error)\\r\\n        }\\r\\n      }\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">state</span> === <span class=\\"hljs-variable constant_\\">PENDING</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">handlers</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(handle)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">queueMicrotask</span>(handle)\\r\\n    })\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span>(onRejected) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>, onRejected)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">static</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">MyPromise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve</span>) =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(value))\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">static</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">reason</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">MyPromise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">_, reject</span>) =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(reason))\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q161-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>回调必须异步执行（这里用 <code>queueMicrotask</code>），否则 <code>then</code> 里注册的回调会同步嵌套，出现“时而同步时而异步”的 Zalgo 问题。</li>\\n<li>采纳 thenable 时要异步调用其 <code>then</code>，并用 <code>try/catch</code> 包住 <code>value.then</code> 的读取（可能是 getter）。状态守卫保证只 settle 一次，重复 <code>resolve</code>/<code>reject</code> 会被忽略。</li>\\n<li><code>then</code> 必须返回新的 Promise 才能支持链式；回调返回值会经 <code>resolve</code> 再次解析（可能是普通值、Promise 或 thenable），链上抛错转成拒绝。</li>\\n<li>简化点：未实现 <code>finally</code>、<code>all</code>/<code>allSettled</code>/<code>race</code>/<code>any</code>、自解析（<code>resolve</code> 传入自身应抛 <code>TypeError</code>）、<code>Species</code>/子类、未处理拒绝的全局报告、以及 thenable 递归深度限制。</li>\\n<li>与原生 Promise 的调度细节略有差异，但“异步、单次 settle、链式、错误传播”这四个语义是一致的。规范见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-promise-objects\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript Promise Objects</a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q161-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么 <code>then</code> 回调不能同步调用？</strong> 让回调运行在当前同步代码之后，保证顺序可预测，并避免回调中再注册的回调产生同步嵌套。</li>\\n<li><strong><code>all</code>/<code>race</code> 怎么加？</strong> 组合多个 <code>then</code>：<code>all</code> 用计数器收集并保持输入顺序，<code>race</code> 用一个标志让首个 settle 生效；注意 <code>resolve</code>/<code>reject</code> 幂等。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7708}},{"id":162,"slug":"question-162","title":"手写 Promise.allSettled","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","Promise","allSettled"],"estimatedMinutes":10,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>allSettled(iterable)</code>：返回数组，每项为 <code>{ status: 'fulfilled', value }</code> 或 <code>{ status: 'rejected', reason }</code>，保持输入顺序，必须等全部 settle 后才 fulfilled，自身不因元素失败而拒绝。空输入返回 <code>[]</code>，非 iterable 输入应拒绝。说明它与 <code>Promise.all</code> 的取舍。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q162-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>为每个元素注册成功与失败两个处理器，把结果按输入下标写入数组；用剩余计数器判断是否全部完成。计数初始为 1 作为“遍历尚未结束”的哨兵，避免空输入被误判为已完成。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q162-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">allSettled</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">iterable</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve, reject</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> results = []\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> remaining = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> index = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">try</span> {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> iterable) {\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> current = index++\\r\\n        results.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>)\\r\\n        remaining += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(value).<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">result</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n            results[current] = { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fulfilled'</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">value</span>: result }\\r\\n            <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (--remaining === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(results)\\r\\n          },\\r\\n          <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">reason</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n            results[current] = { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">status</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'rejected'</span>, reason }\\r\\n            <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (--remaining === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(results)\\r\\n          },\\r\\n        )\\r\\n      }\\r\\n    } <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">catch</span> (error) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(error)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (--remaining === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>(results)\\r\\n  })\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q162-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>元素失败不会让外层拒绝，只有输入不可迭代（<code>for...of</code> 同步抛错）时才拒绝；哨兵计数保证空输入与遍历结束都被正确识别。</li>\\n<li>结果按输入下标排列，与 settle 顺序无关；稀疏数组的空位按 <code>undefined</code> 处理。</li>\\n<li><code>Promise.all</code>：首个拒绝立即让整体拒绝，其余结果被丢弃；<code>Promise.allSettled</code>：总是等全部结束并保留每项状态。需要汇总成功/失败/重试时用 <code>allSettled</code>，需要快速失败时用 <code>all</code>。</li>\\n<li>这是对原生语义的等价实现，原生定义见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/control-abstraction-objects.html#sec-promise.allsettled\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">ECMAScript <code>Promise.allSettled</code></a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q162-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>还想区分“超时”等状态怎么办？</strong> 在 <code>reason</code> 上附加字段或在包装层另记状态，不要改变规范约定的 <code>status</code> 枚举。</li>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能 <code>map</code> 后直接 <code>push</code>？</strong> 会按 settle 顺序排列，破坏与输入下标的对应关系。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7830}},{"id":163,"slug":"question-163","title":"带指数退避与取消的轮询 poll","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","轮询","AbortSignal","退避"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>poll(task, options)</code>：反复调用 <code>task(attempt)</code> 直到返回真值或达到 <code>maxAttempts</code>；每次未命中后等待，等待时间按 <code>backoff</code> 增长并封顶 <code>maxInterval</code>；外部 <code>signal</code> 取消时立即以 <code>signal.reason</code> 拒绝并停止。命中时返回该真值，次数用尽返回 <code>undefined</code>。<code>task</code> 抛错时应向外拒绝。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q163-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>把“等待”抽成可取消的 <code>sleep</code>：定时器与 <code>abort</code> 监听成对清理，取消时立刻拒绝而不等定时器。主循环在每次迭代前检查 <code>signal</code>，命中即返回，否则按当前延迟等待并用退避系数增长、封顶。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q163-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sleep</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">ms, signal</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve, reject</span>) =></span> {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">aborted</span>) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(signal.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">reason</span>)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span>\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">onAbort</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) => {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">clearTimeout</span>(timer)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">reject</span>(signal.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">reason</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> timer = <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">setTimeout</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n      signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">removeEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, onAbort)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n    }, ms)\\r\\n    signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'abort'</span>, onAbort, { <span class=\\"hljs-attr\\">once</span>: <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span> })\\r\\n  })\\r\\n}\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">poll</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">\\r\\n  task,\\r\\n  { interval = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1000</span>, maxAttempts = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">Infinity</span>, maxInterval = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">30000</span>, backoff = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">2</span>, signal } = {},\\r\\n</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> delay = interval\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> attempt = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>; attempt &#x3C;= maxAttempts; attempt += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) {\\r\\n    signal?.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">throwIfAborted</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> result = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">task</span>(attempt)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (result) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> result\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (attempt === maxAttempts) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">break</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">sleep</span>(delay, signal)\\r\\n    delay = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">min</span>(delay * backoff, maxInterval)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">undefined</span>\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q163-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>每次迭代前用 <code>signal.throwIfAborted()</code> 快速失败；<code>sleep</code> 期间监听 <code>abort</code>，取消立即生效且不会残留定时器或监听器，避免内存泄漏。</li>\\n<li>定时器受任务队列与后台节流影响，不保证精确间隔；<code>backoff × delay</code> 必须封顶，否则整数会溢出或无限增长。<code>maxInterval</code> 应不小于 <code>interval</code>。</li>\\n<li>单个 <code>task</code> 抛错会默认中断整个轮询并向调用方拒绝；若希望忽略偶发错误继续重试，应在 <code>task</code> 内 <code>try/catch</code> 或增加错误重试策略。</li>\\n<li><code>maxAttempts</code> 为 0 或负数时应直接返回 <code>undefined</code>，注意循环边界。幂等查询适合轮询；非幂等操作慎用。</li>\\n<li>多个消费者可加抖动（jitter）避免惊群，或复用同一 Promise（见第 172 题）。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q163-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何避免多个组件重复轮询？</strong> 把轮询结果做成共享订阅或 in-flight 复用，而不是各自 <code>setInterval</code>。</li>\\n<li><strong>退避何时应重置？</strong> 成功或状态变化后可重置 <code>delay</code>，只有连续失败才增长。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7890}},{"id":164,"slug":"question-164","title":"实现串行任务队列","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","队列","串行"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>createQueue()</code>，提供 <code>add(task)</code> 返回 promise：任务按加入顺序<strong>串行</strong>执行（并发恒为 1），前一个 settle 后才启动下一个；单个任务失败不影响后续任务，其拒绝只传递给对应 <code>add</code> 的 promise。再提供 <code>onIdle()</code>，在队列清空时 resolve。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q164-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用一条 <code>tail</code> promise 链把任务串起来：每次把新任务挂在链尾，再更新链尾为“吞掉结果”的 promise，从而前一个任务结束（无论成败）都会触发下一个。用计数器维护在途数量，<code>onIdle</code> 在归零时通知。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q164-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">createQueue</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> tail = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> pending = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> idleResolvers = []\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">notifyIdle</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> resolvers = idleResolvers\\r\\n    idleResolvers = []\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> resolve <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> resolvers) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">add</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">task</span>) {\\r\\n    pending += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> run = tail.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(task, task)\\r\\n    tail = run.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {},\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {},\\r\\n    )\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> run.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">finally</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n      pending -= <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (pending === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">notifyIdle</span>()\\r\\n    })\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">onIdle</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\"></span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (pending === <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">resolve</span>) =></span> idleResolvers.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(resolve))\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> { add, onIdle }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q164-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>串行由 <code>tail</code> 链保证：<code>tail.then(task, task)</code> 让任务在上一个 settle 后才执行，两个处理器都传 <code>task</code> 使前一个的失败被吸收，从而不阻断后续任务。</li>\\n<li><code>add</code> 返回的 promise 单独反映该任务结果；队列不聚合错误，失败不会污染其它任务的 promise。调用方若不处理 <code>add</code> 的拒绝会产生未处理拒绝。</li>\\n<li><code>onIdle</code> 在无待处理任务时立即 resolve；<code>add</code> 的 <code>finally</code> 与 idle 通知存在时序关系，使用计数与批量 resolve 避免遗漏或重复通知。</li>\\n<li>每次 <code>then</code> 会保留微任务链，极长队列会增加内存；同时 <code>pending</code> 的增减依赖 <code>finally</code>，注意它不影响 <code>run</code> 本身的结果。</li>\\n<li>与并发限制器（第 88 题 <code>mapLimit</code>）相反：这里并发恒为 1，表达的是顺序而非数量上限。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q164-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何加取消或超时？</strong> 给 <code>task</code> 传 <code>AbortSignal</code>，或在 <code>run</code> 外层用超时 <code>race</code>；取消不代表任务已经停止，副作用仍需幂等处理。</li>\\n<li><strong>队列和防抖有什么区别？</strong> 队列保证顺序与串行、不合并重复调用；防抖是合并高频调用、只执行最后一次。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":7956}},{"id":165,"slug":"question-165","title":"手写 deepEqual","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","deepEqual","递归"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>deepEqual(a, b)</code>：递归比较原始值、普通对象、数组、<code>Date</code> 与 <code>RegExp</code>；<code>NaN</code> 视为相等，<code>-0</code> 与 <code>0</code> 不相等；支持循环引用；不要求比较 <code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code>/类实例（按引用比较）。说明为什么不能用 <code>JSON.stringify</code> 替代。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q165-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>先按引用与 <code>Object.is</code> 快速判定（同时处理 <code>NaN</code> 与 <code>-0</code>），再判断类型、特例对象（<code>Date</code>/<code>RegExp</code>），最后递归比较数组元素与对象自有可枚举键。用 <code>Map</code> 记录已访问的 <code>a→b</code> 配对，既避免循环引用无限递归，也校验结构一致。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q165-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepEqual</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">a, b, seen = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">Map</span>()</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">is</span>(a, b)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> a !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> || <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> b !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> || a === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> || b === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> paired = seen.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(a)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (paired) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> paired === b\\r\\n  seen.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(a, b)\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (a <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">instanceof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Date</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> a.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getTime</span>() === b.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getTime</span>()\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (a <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">instanceof</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">RegExp</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> a.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">source</span> === b.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">source</span> &#x26;&#x26; a.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">flags</span> === b.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">flags</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> aIsArray = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(a)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (aIsArray !== <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(b)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (aIsArray) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (a.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span> !== b.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> index = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>; index &#x3C; a.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span>; index += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepEqual</span>(a[index], b[index], seen)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> aKeys = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">keys</span>(a)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> bKeys = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">keys</span>(b)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (aKeys.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span> !== bKeys.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> key <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> aKeys) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">hasOwn</span>(b, key) || !<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">deepEqual</span>(a[key], b[key], seen)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">false</span>\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">true</span>\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q165-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>用 <code>Object.is</code> 处理两件原生比较会出错的事：<code>NaN</code> 与自身相等、<code>-0</code> 与 <code>0</code> 不相等；<code>===</code> 会把 <code>NaN</code> 判为不等，<code>+0</code>/<code>-0</code> 判为相等。</li>\\n<li>只比较数组与普通对象的自有可枚举字符串键；<code>Symbol</code> 键、不可枚举属性、原型链属性不参与。若两个不同构造函数的实例键相同，会被判为相等——这是“只比较数据”的取舍。</li>\\n<li><code>Date</code> 用 <code>getTime</code>、<code>RegExp</code> 用 <code>source + flags</code>；不要依赖 <code>toString</code>，它受本地化/格式影响。</li>\\n<li>循环引用依赖 <code>seen</code> 的配对记录；数组空位在本实现中按 <code>undefined</code> 比较（与原生 <code>Array.prototype</code> 的稀疏语义不同）。最坏情况时间 O(节点数)、空间 O(深度 + 配对表)。</li>\\n<li>与结构化克隆、序列化比较的区别见 <a href=\\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/structuredClone\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">structuredClone</a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q165-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不能用 <code>JSON.stringify</code> 比较？</strong> 键顺序会影响结果，<code>undefined</code>/函数/Symbol 会被丢弃，<code>Date</code> 会变成字符串，<code>NaN</code> 变 <code>null</code>，且无法处理循环引用。</li>\\n<li><strong>如何支持 <code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code>？</strong> 需要按集合语义（无序、按值）比较，并同样处理循环引用，复杂度更高，通常交给专门的深比较库。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":8020}},{"id":166,"slug":"question-166","title":"手写 flatten","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"basic","tags":["JavaScript","flatten","递归"],"estimatedMinutes":8,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>flatten(input, depth = 1)</code>：把嵌套数组展平到指定深度，<code>depth</code> 为 <code>Infinity</code> 时完全展平；<code>depth</code> 为 0 时返回浅拷贝；不修改原数组；输入必须是数组，否则抛 <code>TypeError</code>。说明如何处理稀疏数组空位才与原生 <code>Array.prototype.flat</code> 一致。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q166-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用递归遍历并按剩余深度决定是否继续下钻：<code>depth > 0</code> 且元素是数组时继续展平，否则作为结果。用索引循环并借助 <code>index in array</code> 跳过空位，与原生 <code>flat</code> 的行为保持一致。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q166-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">flatten</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">input, depth = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span></span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(input)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'input must be an array'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> limit = depth === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Infinity</span> ? <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Infinity</span> : <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">max</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Math</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">trunc</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Number</span>(depth) || <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>))\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> result = []\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">walk</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">array, level</span>) => {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">let</span> index = <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>; index &#x3C; array.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">length</span>; index += <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!(index <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">in</span> array)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">continue</span>\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value = array[index]\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (level > <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span> &#x26;&#x26; <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(value)) <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">walk</span>(value, level - <span class=\\"hljs-number\\">1</span>)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">else</span> result.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">push</span>(value)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">walk</span>(input, limit)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> result\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q166-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>depth = Infinity</code> 时 <code>level - 1</code> 仍为 <code>Infinity</code>，可完全展平；<code>depth = 0</code> 不做下钻，等价于浅拷贝顶层。负数按 0 处理（也可改为按契约报错，但必须明确）。</li>\\n<li>原生 <code>Array.prototype.flat</code> 会<strong>跳过</strong>稀疏数组空位，结果不含空洞；<code>for...of</code> 会把空位读成 <code>undefined</code>，两者不一致，所以这里用索引 + <code>in</code> 判断。</li>\\n<li>只展平数组元素，类数组对象与其它可迭代对象不处理（与原生一致）。返回新数组，不修改输入。</li>\\n<li>极深嵌套的递归可能栈溢出；需要吞吐时改写为显式栈的迭代版本。规范见 <a href=\\"https://tc39.es/ecma262/multipage/indexed-collections.html#sec-array.prototype.flat\\" rel=\\"noopener noreferrer\\" target=\\"_blank\\">Array.prototype.flat</a>。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q166-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何实现 <code>flatMap</code>？</strong> 先 <code>map</code> 再按一层展平，注意 <code>map</code> 结果里保留的空位与 <code>flat</code> 跳过空位的行为差异。</li>\\n<li><strong>如何做完全展平且保序？</strong> 用栈逆序压入子数组元素，迭代过程中同样跳过空位。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":8085}},{"id":167,"slug":"question-167","title":"手写 memoize","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","memoize","缓存","LRU"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>memoize(fn, { resolver, maxSize })</code>：缓存 <code>fn</code> 的结果，缓存键默认取第一个参数，或由 <code>resolver(...args)</code> 计算；<code>maxSize</code> 限制缓存条目数，超出时淘汰最久未使用的一项；命中后应刷新该项的使用顺序。说明缓存 Promise、<code>this</code> 依赖与可变参数键的注意点。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q167-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>用 <code>Map</code> 的插入顺序实现 LRU：命中时先 <code>delete</code> 再 <code>set</code> 把该项移到队尾，超限时删掉队首（<code>Map</code> 迭代的第一个键，即最久未用）。键由 <code>resolver</code> 决定，默认只取第一个参数。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q167-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">memoize</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">fn, { resolver, maxSize = <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">Infinity</span> } = {}</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> fn !== <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'function'</span>) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">TypeError</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'fn must be a function'</span>)\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> cache = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">memoized</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...args</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> key = resolver ? <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolver</span>(...args) : args[<span class=\\"hljs-number\\">0</span>]\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">has</span>(key)) {\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value = cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(key)\\r\\n      cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(key)\\r\\n      cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(key, value)\\r\\n      <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> value\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> value = fn.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">apply</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-variable language_\\">this</span>, args)\\r\\n    cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(key, value)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (cache.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">size</span> > maxSize) {\\r\\n      cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(cache.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">keys</span>().<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">next</span>().<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">value</span>)\\r\\n    }\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> value\\r\\n  }\\r\\n\\r\\n  memoized.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\">cache</span> = cache\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> memoized\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q167-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>默认键只取第一个参数；多参数或对象参数应自定义 <code>resolver</code>。对象键按引用判定，内容相同但引用不同会各自缓存，需要时可序列化或使用其他等同策略并在注释中说明代价。</li>\\n<li>只对纯函数安全：依赖外部可变状态或参数以外输入的函数会返回陈旧值。<code>this</code> 依赖的函数，缓存键应包含 <code>this</code> 或避免共用缓存。</li>\\n<li>若 <code>fn</code> 返回 Promise，失败也会被缓存；不希望缓存失败时可在写入前 <code>Promise.resolve(value).catch(() => cache.delete(key))</code> 再返回该 Promise。</li>\\n<li><code>maxSize</code> 为 0 应视为禁用缓存；<code>Infinity</code> 不淘汰。<code>Map.keys().next().value</code> 取的是最久未使用的键。</li>\\n<li>命中路径只做 O(1) 的 Map 操作；总空间受 <code>maxSize</code> 约束。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q167-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何避免缓存被拒绝的 Promise？</strong> 在写入缓存前先处理拒绝分支，或在失败时移除对应键；同时让调用方拿到原始 Promise，不要吞掉错误。</li>\\n<li><strong>如何加 TTL？</strong> 存 <code>{ value, expireAt }</code>，读取时校验过期并删除。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":8132}},{"id":172,"slug":"question-172","title":"相同请求合并（in-flight 去重）","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"advanced","tags":["JavaScript","请求","并发","缓存"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>createRequestMerger(requestFn, { key })</code>：当相同 <code>key</code> 的请求正在进行时，复用同一个 in-flight Promise，不重复发起；请求 settle（成功或失败）后移除记录。要求 <code>requestFn</code> 的同步抛错也表现为拒绝，且不能因为清理而误删“更新的”请求记录。说明这与响应缓存的区别，以及失败如何被多个调用方共享。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q172-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>维护一张 <code>key → Promise</code> 的 in-flight 表。发起前先查表：命中就返回同一个 Promise；未命中则用 <code>Promise.resolve().then(() => requestFn(...))</code> 包装，保证同步抛错也变成拒绝，并在任何 <code>.then</code> 注册前把 Promise 存入表，避免同步重入漏合并。<code>finally</code> 里比较身份再删除，防止旧请求删掉新记录。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q172-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">createRequestMerger</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">requestFn, { key = (...args) => <span class=\\"hljs-built_in\\">JSON</span>.stringify(args) } = {}</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> inflight = <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Map</span>()\\r\\n\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">merged</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">...args</span>) {\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> cacheKey = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">key</span>(...args)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> existing = inflight.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(cacheKey)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (existing) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> existing\\r\\n\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> promise = <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Promise</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">resolve</span>()\\r\\n      .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">then</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">requestFn</span>(...args))\\r\\n      .<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">finally</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">() =></span> {\\r\\n        <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (inflight.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">get</span>(cacheKey) === promise) inflight.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">delete</span>(cacheKey)\\r\\n      })\\r\\n\\r\\n    inflight.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">set</span>(cacheKey, promise)\\r\\n    <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> promise\\r\\n  }\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q172-section-2","title":"设计要点与边界","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>只合并“同时进行”的调用；settle 后立即移除记录，下一次是新请求（不是缓存）。需要跨时间复用得另加 TTL/LRU 响应缓存，两者语义不同。</li>\\n<li>失败不缓存，但并发复用者会一起失败：多个调用方共享同一个已拒绝的 Promise。若不希望共享失败，需要有重试或让后续调用重新发起（但当前并发者仍共享同一次失败）。</li>\\n<li>默认 <code>key</code> 用 <code>JSON.stringify(args)</code>：对参数<strong>顺序</strong>敏感（<code>{a,b}</code> 与 <code>{b,a}</code> 视为不同），对象内容相同则相同；<code>FormData</code>、函数、循环引用无法序列化，应自定义 <code>key</code> 或跳过合并。非 GET 请求合并不安全，需按业务决定。</li>\\n<li><code>Promise.resolve().then(...)</code> 让 <code>requestFn</code> 的同步异常也变成拒绝；在存入表之前不 <code>await</code>，避免并发重入时漏合并。</li>\\n<li><code>finally</code> 的身份比较与 Map 引用释放共同防止“误删”和内存泄漏。</li>\\n<li>该模式即 Go 的 <code>singleflight</code>（请求合并/去重）：并发相同 key 只执行一次，结果广播给所有调用方。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q172-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>为什么不用一个结果缓存？</strong> 响应缓存跨时间复用已完成结果，语义是“缓存”；singleflight 只解决并发重复，settle 后即释放。</li>\\n<li><strong>缓存过期瞬间的惊群怎么办？</strong> 把 singleflight 与 TTL 组合：过期时只放一个真实请求穿透，其余复用。</li>\\n<li><strong>取消/超时如何处理？</strong> 复用同一个 Promise 意味着调用方共享取消；要独立取消需引用计数并暴露一个 manager，或把同一个 <code>AbortSignal</code> 传给底层请求。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":8377}},{"id":175,"slug":"question-175","title":"递归转换键名风格（snake_case ↔ camelCase）","category":"javascript","type":"coding","difficulty":"intermediate","tags":["JavaScript","数据转换","递归"],"estimatedMinutes":12,"promptHtml":"<p>实现 <code>convertKeys(input, transform)</code>：递归转换普通对象与数组内所有对象的键名，例如 <code>snakeToCamel('user_id')</code> → <code>userId</code>、<code>camelToSnake('userName')</code> → <code>user_name</code>。要求不修改原对象，<code>Date</code>/<code>RegExp</code>/<code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code>/函数/类实例以及数组元素值原样保留。说明键名冲突与缩写词带来的边界。</p>","answerSections":[{"id":"q175-section-0","title":"核心答案","html":"<p>只用递归处理“普通对象”和数组：数组 <code>map</code> 递归元素，普通对象用 <code>Object.entries</code> 逐键改名并递归值，其它类型直接返回。用原型判断普通对象，避免误伤 <code>Date</code>、类实例等会丢失原型/方法的值。</p>\\n"},{"id":"q175-section-1","title":"参考实现","html":"\\n<pre><code class=\\"hljs language-js\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isPlainObject</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">value</span>) =>\\r\\n  value !== <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span> &#x26;&#x26;\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">typeof</span> value === <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'object'</span> &#x26;&#x26;\\r\\n  (<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(value) === <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-property\\"><span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">prototype</span></span> || <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">getPrototypeOf</span>(value) === <span class=\\"hljs-literal\\">null</span>)\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">snakeToCamel</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">key</span>) => key.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">replace</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-regexp\\">/[_-]+([a-zA-Z0-9])/g</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">_, char</span>) =></span> char.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">toUpperCase</span>())\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">camelToSnake</span> = (<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">key</span>) => key.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">replace</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-regexp\\">/([a-z0-9])([A-Z])/g</span>, <span class=\\"hljs-string\\">'$1_$2'</span>).<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">toLowerCase</span>()\\r\\n\\r\\n<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">convertKeys</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">input, transform</span>) {\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Array</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isArray</span>(input)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> input.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">map</span>(<span class=\\"hljs-function\\">(<span class=\\"hljs-params\\">item</span>) =></span> <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">convertKeys</span>(item, transform))\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">if</span> (!<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">isPlainObject</span>(input)) <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> input\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> output = {}\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">for</span> (<span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">const</span> [key, value] <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">of</span> <span class=\\"hljs-title class_\\">Object</span>.<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">entries</span>(input)) {\\r\\n    output[<span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">transform</span>(key)] = <span class=\\"hljs-title function_\\">convertKeys</span>(value, transform)\\r\\n  }\\r\\n  <span class=\\"hljs-keyword\\">return</span> output\\r\\n}\\n</code></pre>\\n"},{"id":"q175-section-2","title":"边界与易错点","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li>只递归普通对象与数组；<code>Date</code>/<code>RegExp</code>/<code>Map</code>/<code>Set</code>/函数/类实例必须原样返回，否则会丢失原型、方法或内部状态。<code>typeof x === 'object'</code> 不足以判定普通对象。</li>\\n<li>返回全新结构，不修改输入；数组返回新数组。键名冲突（如同时存在 <code>user_id</code> 与 <code>userId</code>）会互相覆盖，遇到时应检测并报错或定义优先级。</li>\\n<li>缩写词存在歧义：<code>HTTPResponse</code>、<code>userID</code> 的正则转换结果取决于约定，单向转换可能无法完美还原；应明确规则并加测试（如 <code>userID</code> → <code>user_id</code> 还是 <code>user_i_d</code>）。</li>\\n<li>含中文、前导数字或特殊字符的键不宜强转，可原样保留。深层结构与循环引用需额外的 <code>seen</code>（<code>WeakMap</code>）保护或明确不支持。</li>\\n<li>复杂度 O(节点数)。若要在类型层保留转换后的键，可结合模板字面量类型与递归映射类型（见第 154、171 题），运行时仍按实际字符串处理。</li>\\n</ul>\\n"},{"id":"q175-section-3","title":"追问","html":"\\n<ul>\\n<li><strong>如何双向无损转换？</strong> 单向命名转换本身有损，通常只从接口格式转入内部格式；需要回传时在请求适配器里按后端的命名约定显式生成。</li>\\n<li><strong>遇到循环引用怎么办？</strong> 传入 <code>WeakMap</code> 记录已访问对象，命中直接返回，避免无限递归。</li>\\n</ul>"}],"source":{"file":"fe/JavaScript_React原理与实战模拟面试题库.md","line":8559}}]`);export{e as default};